mments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T22:21:18Z","email":"69012359+Duvet05@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Gonzalo Galvez Cortez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T22:21:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Odontograma cambios (#484)\n\n* feat: enhance odontogram dashboard with record list and improved styling\n\n- Added OdontogramRecordList component to display a list of odontogram records with selection and action capabilities.\n- Introduced new SCSS styles for the OdontogramRecordList component to improve layout and responsiveness.\n- Updated OdontogramWorkspace to handle new props for base encounter and save actions.\n- Enhanced odontogram resource functions to fetch and manage encounter observations.\n- Implemented logic to reuse existing observation UUIDs during updates to avoid duplicates.\n- Refactored OdontologiaDashboard to streamline the display of odontogram components.\n- Updated translations for new features and improved clarity in user prompts.\n\n* feat: refactor odontogram components and add solution counting functionality\n\n* feat: update odontogram terminology and improve translations for clarity\n\n* feat: enhance odontogram dashboard with improved workspace titles and translations\n\n* feat: enhance odontogram dashboard with improved layout, new functionality, and updated translations\n\n* feat: enhance odontogram dashboard with draft functionality and pagination\n\n- Updated odontogram-dashboard.scss to improve padding and added styles for editing banners and buttons.\n- Refactored odontogram-record-list.component.tsx to support draft records, pagination, and improved selection handling.\n- Enhanced odontogram-record-list.scss with styles for draft cards and pagination.\n- Modified odontogram-workspace.component.tsx to include form selection state management.\n- Adjusted odontogram-workspace.scss for better button alignment.\n- Updated Odontogram component to handle form selection state.\n- Improved OdontogramTextFields for editable and read-only states.\n- Enhanced OdontogramProvider to manage form selection across components.\n- Updated odontogramDataStore to include form selection state management.\n- Added new translation keys for draft functionality in both English and Spanish.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mauricio Arenales <arenales.mauricio24@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd379f8c847288397ff1b96498c3d86ebd617d33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dolsoc/Imagenes_Medicas/git/trees/fd379f8c847288397ff1b96498c3d86ebd617d33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Dolsoc/Imagenes_Medicas/git/commits/99933ea616c0a5c026e3a50d53b0da48fa485019","verification":{"payload":"tree fd379f8c847288397ff1b96498c3d86ebd617d33\nparent 4ed42f1da379aa208fba2148234386167290617d\nauthor Gonzalo Galvez Cortez <69012359+Duvet05@users.noreply.github.com> 1783635678 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783635678 -0500\n\nOdontograma cambios (#484)\n\n* feat: enhance odontogram dashboard with record list and improved styling\n\n- Added OdontogramRecordList component to display a list of odontogram records with selection and action capabilities.\n- Introduced new SCSS styles for the OdontogramRecordList component to improve layout and responsiveness.\n- Updated OdontogramWorkspace to handle new props for base encounter and save actions.\n- Enhanced odontogram resource functions to fetch and manage encounter observations.\n- Implemented logic to reuse existing observation UUIDs during updates to avoid duplicates.\n- Refactored OdontologiaDashboard to streamline the display of odontogram components.\n- Updated translations for new features and improved clarity in user prompts.\n\n* feat: refactor odontogram components and add solution counting functionality\n\n* feat: update odontogram terminology and improve translations for clarity\n\n* feat: enhance odontogram dashboard with improved workspace titles and translations\n\n* feat: enhance odontogram dashboard with improved layout, new functionality, and updated translations\n\n* feat: enhance odontogram dashboard with draft functionality and pagination\n\n- Updated odontogram-dashboard.scss to improve padding and added styles for editing banners and buttons.\n- Refactored odontogram-record-list.component.tsx to support draft records, pagination, and improved selection handling.\n- Enhanced odontogram-record-list.scss with styles for draft cards and pagination.\n- Modified odontogram-workspace.component.tsx to include form selection state management.\n- Adjusted odontogram-workspace.scss for better button alignment.\n- Updated Odontogram component to handle form selection state.\n- Improved OdontogramTextFields for editable and read-only states.\n- Enhanced OdontogramProvider to manage form selection across components.\n- Updated odontogramDataStore to include form selection state management.\n- Added new translation keys for draft functionality in both English and Spanish.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Mauricio Arenales <arenales.mauricio24@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUB7eCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAm88QADdhLB+G+eaJ4UMGf5KXb+vc\nN2ut8v7f4odGu1kwWAmeWN4G4zQOKhX0CpH2bRxrVz33frjF4FxDsuiYq7xoPlmz\n0uJqrYAlIBbtP0EwXDD/HKgForo/37Jh2H3C6m2uM2SOq1QvfGyiakYOPjoJoHor\nYdw5fIKqKyb9WkMZIzk+QAPEuWzDvpKtrizWGZ51OHFRNJ1b+zCEr42pz6W6L+o+\nHFADJOt3BILlQ1tJhmzzHGYnUKjkDBlD+FtQcjabJYYhAn6YF2EJcWt2yS82As73\na2KJMc+xE1Sp65SlcxKUt25BF/VKmdJWhU3iPq6hUI96YQN9+9Xs0lEyWVTym2rw\njzl+qbhKMe2OKJKWvXW4kKz9VEPlfdBrUiJXezEeoj/5P6xtEd/o/F3b+sqbVRAQ\nyvYev6OVqb/VUQY9DwS/T76XbWZIPzK29TLt2VgyR3Hn8d4EZxCf5eWzbr0c6YNu\ngh4iPN+7bJbhlR7udKiCX7sGtx1ES4PjfISiwc8yLLXvC459watURfO2HqxZGZzt\nCulYV9LJj2RkVdegUCHycvm73dQmn0AKKN/gmpM+Wpg0mRO5jaZyfXnzNGoVldaa\nHUTthZvFxI+PAwMoiu4tP6583Rhl2408ME1svn801REN/FOjcvbWnItPVJrO4dZl\n80ce+MM8D/WQTHbj0dmI\n=1v0W\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-14T17:15:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://ava