e":"Shivansh Karan"},"message":"feat(profile): implement Wave 3 Career Profile and resume parsing endpoints\n\n- Created LLMParserService utilizing Gemini structured outputs to extract profile data, handle date parsing fallbacks, and calculate a weighted confidence score.\n- Created ProfileSyncService to coordinate gate-controlled resume updates, version snapshotting, and synchronization tracking.\n- Implemented API v2 profile endpoints: GET/PUT profile, version listing, version restoration, and resume upload & sync.\n- Added strict length checks to reject scanned documents (<50 chars) with HTTP 422.\n- Enforced schema constraints (at most two concurrent active jobs, start_date <= end_date).\n- Added comprehensive unit and integration tests in test_profile.py.\n- Added database connection cleanup fixtures in tests to prevent closed event loop pool warnings.","tree":{"sha":"6ad134f7c7e75bd14c9fbaf9e114cc768b64bf01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SpaceTesla/CareerPilot/git/trees/6ad134f7c7e75bd14c9fbaf9e114cc768b64bf01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SpaceTesla/CareerPilot/git/commits/c6abcf1f344031ce3465c4487b8d5effa9265e5f","verification":{"payload":"tree 6ad134f7c7e75bd14c9fbaf9e114cc768b64bf01\nparent 9de1cede7db3758a298217565d4726102bfede00\nauthor Shivansh Karan <96942282+SpaceTesla@users.noreply.github.com> 1780957114 +0530\ncommitter Shivansh Karan <96942282+SpaceTesla@users.noreply.github.com> 1780957114 +0530\n\nfeat(profile): implement Wave 3 Career Profile and resume parsing endpoints\n\n- Created LLMParserService utilizing Gemini structured outputs to extract profile data, handle date parsing fallbacks, and calculate a weighted confidence score.\n- Created ProfileSyncService to coordinate gate-controlled resume updates, version snapshotting, and synchronization tracking.\n- Implemented API v2 profile endpoints: GET/PUT profile, version listing, version restoration, and resume upload & sync.\n- Added strict length checks to reject scanned docume