,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T21:23:05Z","email":"96942282+SpaceTesla@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shivansh Karan"},"message":"feat(foundation): initialize project setup, backing services, and health routing\n\n- Add asynchronous PostgreSQL connection layer via `asyncpg` and SQLAlchemy 2.0 with connection pooling (`pool_size=20`, `max_overflow=10`, `pool_pre_ping=True`).\n- Add async `RedisService` and `QdrantService` health verification checkers measuring connection latency.\n- Add `RequestIDMiddleware` for log tracing context and register `TrustedHostMiddleware` in `main.py`.\n- Add structured JSON formatting for standard output and file log handlers.\n- Add Alembic migration setup dynamically pulling environment database URLs and registering base schemas.\n- Add `Dockerfile.dev` and update `compose.yaml` to orchestrate Postgres, Redis, Qdrant, and hot-reloading FastAPI containers.\n- Add `/api/v2/health` route returning detailed backend status and connection latency.\n- Add comprehensive test suite in `backend/src/tests/test_foundation.py` covering settings validations, health services, and FastAPI endpoint routes.","tree":{"sha":"18bc1cc4c64b4111240122918b5522b4f9f6e996","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SpaceTesla/CareerPilot/git/trees/18bc1cc4c64b4111240122918b5522b4f9f6e996"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SpaceTesla/CareerPilot/git/commits/e9692c778085577a93de5ce23162871986042b30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96942282?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceTesla/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceTesla/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceTesla/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceTesla/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SpaceTesla","id":96942282,"login":"SpaceTesla",