om/users/SpaceTesla","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SpaceTesla/CareerPilot/commits/e5969658aa99ccd1ab7621dc8399d95c7dc1fabf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T20:41:45Z","email":"96942282+SpaceTesla@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shivansh Karan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T20:41:45Z","email":"96942282+SpaceTesla@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shivansh Karan"},"message":"Add architectural decision records (ADRs) for key components in CareerPilot V2\n\n- ADR 0006: Introduce Temporal.io for durable workflow orchestration, detailing implementation strategy and alternatives considered.\n- ADR 0007: Adopt LangGraph as the core multi-agent orchestration framework, emphasizing structured state management and observability.\n- ADR 0008: Establish a Supervisor-Coordinated Multi-Agent Topology to enhance task specialization and routing accuracy.\n- ADR 0009: Implement a hybrid token-based authentication strategy using JWTs and bcrypt for secure session management.\n- ADR 0010: Design an event-driven architecture with a transactional outbox pattern for decoupled domain communication.\n- ADR 0011: Develop a hybrid multi-stage retrieval architecture to optimize job matching and talent discovery, ensuring high precision and performance.","tree":{"sha":"532b29bf364db16f0e0d64f3c2f1b04f796a2ac2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SpaceTesla/CareerPilot/git/trees/532b29bf364db16f0e0d64f3c2f1b04f796a2ac2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SpaceTesla/CareerPilot/git/commits/e5969658aa99ccd1ab7621dc8399d95c7dc1fabf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96942282?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceTesla/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceTesla/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceTesla/followi