la","id":96942282,"login":"SpaceTesla","node_id":"U_kgDOBcc4yg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceTesla/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceTesla/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceTesla/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceTesla/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceTesla/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SpaceTesla","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SpaceTesla/CareerPilot/commits/675b0bfd33265b33f1d22fd4e364ec27f53dafaa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-14T10:47:27Z","email":"96942282+SpaceTesla@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shivansh Karan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-14T10:47:27Z","email":"96942282+SpaceTesla@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shivansh Karan"},"message":"feat: enhance agent chat functionality with user session management\n\n- Introduced user session resolution in the `agent_chat` endpoint to improve user experience by retrieving user IDs from session data.\n- Added a new `_resolve_user_id` function to handle user ID extraction from requests and conversations.\n- Implemented session ID management in the resume upload process to ensure continuity in user interactions.\n- Enhanced the `ConversationRepository` with a method to retrieve conversations by ID, supporting user session resolution.\n- Updated the `AgentService` to utilize a memory management system for maintaining conversation history, improving context awareness in chat interactions.\n- Refactored course recommendation tools to load user context from the database, enhancing the relevance of suggestions based on user profiles.","tree":{"sha":"3626b07ad692891d8f132a86cbc751b27e42d85a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SpaceTesla/CareerPilot/git/trees/3626b07ad692891d8f132a86cbc751b27e42d85a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SpaceT