ntheticDefaultImports, ignoreDeprecations)\n- Add \"files\": [\"dist\"] to 74 packages missing it\n- Add \"type\": \"module\" to philjs and philjs-polyglot\n- Fix placeholder URLs (yourusername -> PhilipJohnBasile)\n- Move @types/vscode from deps to devDeps in philjs-ai\n- Remove \"workspaces\" from root package.json (pnpm uses pnpm-workspace.yaml)\n- Remove pnpm-lock.yaml from .gitignore\n\nP2 fixes:\n- Add \"test\": \"vitest run\" to 19 packages with test files but no test script\n- Remove duplicate benchmark job from CI workflow\n\nAll 225 packages build successfully with tsgo 7.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"73a32e936928901952c9e032834d49b294fbd628","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhilipJohnBasile/philjs/git/trees/73a32e936928901952c9e032834d49b294fbd628"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhilipJohnBasile/philjs/git/commits/8301f2226de1e9f004949bfca8124ea006d16615","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PhilipJohnBasile","id":1419847,"login":"PhilipJohnBasile","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk4NDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/subscriptions",