 for dashboard example\n- Add workbox dependencies for pwa-app service worker\n- Export `computed` from @philjs/core (alias for memo)\n- Fix type-only imports in dashboard (MetricData, Signal)\n- Fix broken dynamic require in philjs-ai assistant\n- Add createAI/providers exports to philjs-ai for storefront\n\nAll 225 packages and examples now build successfully.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84145148160d062c7a68f5d0342937766c00e635","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhilipJohnBasile/philjs/git/trees/84145148160d062c7a68f5d0342937766c00e635"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhilipJohnBasile/philjs/git/commits/9349410f06cec5750cb704cefc2d2189ebed7972","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PhilipJohnBasile","id":1419847,"login":"PhilipJohnBasile","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk4NDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PhilipJohnBasile/philjs/commit/9349410f06cec5750cb704cefc2d2189ebed7972","node_id":"C_kwDOP8bTs9oAKDk