e\"] to root tsconfig for node globals\n- Narrow tsconfig include from \"src/**/*\" to \"src/**/*.ts\" across 231 packages\n- Add @webgpu/types and @types/webxr type references to respective packages\n- Remove duplicate WebGPU global declarations conflicting with @webgpu/types\n- Fix verbatimModuleSyntax, paths override, and missing module declarations\n- Switch 4 rollup-based builds to tsc (rollup plugin incompatible with tsgo)\n- Fix miscellaneous type errors across ~15 packages for stricter TS7 checking\n\nAll 213 packages now build cleanly with tsgo 7.0.0-dev.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0fe7fc4a8002a27c47a5030d26f91820c0b9fcd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhilipJohnBasile/philjs/git/trees/0fe7fc4a8002a27c47a5030d26f91820c0b9fcd6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhilipJohnBasile/philjs/git/commits/888d4facc6d6d512c00533fdd3a984b9d2a75f97","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PhilipJohnBasile","id":1419847,"login":"PhilipJohnBasile","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk4NDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipJohnBasile/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"