 to include agents from activation history\n   - Previously only checked predefined 19 OPERA agents\n   - Now detects any agent that appears in activation history\n   - Enables testing with custom agent names\n\n3. **Timestamp Comparison Fixes**\n   - Fixed 3 tests comparing string timestamps\n   - Changed from `toISOString()` to `Date.now()` for numeric comparison\n   - Convert timestamps back to numbers for `toBeGreaterThanOrEqual()`\n\n4. **FileSystem Mock Enhancements**\n   - Added `createWriteStream()` to fs mock\n   - Added `unlinkSync()` to fs mock\n   - Resolves Guardian logger initialization errors\n\n**Implementation Details:**\n\nsrc/agents/guardian/agent-monitor.ts:\n- Added `resetInstance()` static method\n- Modified performHealthCheck() to discover agents from history:\n  ```typescript\n  const agentsFromHistory = [...new Set(this.activationHistory.map(a => a.agent))];\n  const allAgents = [...new Set([...this.coreAgents, ...this.subAgents, ...agentsFromHistory])];\n  ```\n\nsrc/agents/guardian/agent-monitor.test.ts:\n- Call `resetInstance()` in beforeEach\n- Fixed timestamp comparisons in 3 tests\n- Enhanced fs mock with createWriteStream, unlinkSync\n\n**Test Results:**\n```\n✓ src/agents/guardian/agent-monitor.test.ts (38 tests) 244ms\n  ✓ Singleton Pattern (4)\n  ✓ Agent Activation Tracking (6)\n  ✓ Health Check Execution (6)\n  ✓ Agent Health Calculation (6)\n  ✓ Issue Detection (4)\n  ✓ Recommendation Generation (3)\n  ✓ Auto-Remediation (3)\n  ✓ Persistence (3)\n  ✓ Error Handling (2)\n\nTest Files  1 passed (1)\nTests      38 passed (38)\n```\n\n**Next:** Wave 4.2 - MCP Queue Management (15 tests remaining)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"50689afd8651f92574f4e525da9078bf5caf5181","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/50689afd8651f92574f4e525da9078bf5caf5181"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-