rogress %, currentTool, completedTools, totalTools\n\n**Cancellation Implementation:**\n- Checks `cancelledTasks` set before and during execution\n- Returns `success: false` with \"Task cancelled\" error\n- Prevents execution if cancelled before start\n- Interrupts execution if cancelled mid-run\n\n## Impact\n\nWave 3 improvement: +2 MCP tests passing\nOverall MCP module: 126 → 128 tests passing (~65%)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2d61554d7aab71de5ac17d04bd5df3a917ff7b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/f2d61554d7aab71de5ac17d04bd5df3a917ff7b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/f78dcc3746243713a5f54c6cd46f8877dc7762fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commit/f78dcc3746243713a5f54c6cd46f8877dc7762fb","node_id":"C_kwDOP8mr-toAKGY3OGRjYzM3NDYyNDM3MTNhNWY1NGM2Y2Q0NmY4ODc3ZGM3NzYyZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commit/de993610b1761416a80432bc0ae9077f7931f942","sha":"de993610b1761416a80432bc0ae9077f7931f942","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/de993610b1761416a80432bc0ae9077f7931f942"}],"sha":"f78dcc3746243713a5f54c6cd46f8877dc7762fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/f78dcc3746243713a5f54c6cd46f8877dc7762fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/de993610b1761416a80432bc0ae9077f7931f942/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-20T17:53:51Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-20T17:53:51Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"message":"feat: Wave 2 - Add VerifiedIssueDetector singleton pattern\n\nArchitecture alignment fix for Guardian agent compatibility.\n\n## Changes\n\n**src/agents/guardian/verified-issue-detector.ts:**\n- Added singleton class wrapper `VerifiedIssueDetector`\n- Implements getInstance() static method for test compatibility\n- Added 30+ instance methods for issue detection and verification\n- Fixed evidence timestamp validation (returned string → boolean)\n- Fixed priority score calculation (handle issues without severity)\n\n## Test Results\n\n**VerifiedIssueDetector Tests**: 38/38 passing (100%) ✅\n- Singleton pattern validation\n- Chain-of-Verification detection\n- Evidence collection and validation\n- False positive filtering\n- Priority scoring and ranking\n- Verified TODO creation\n- Issue classification\n- Batch detection\n- Configuration management\n- Edge case handling\n\n## Impact\n\nWave 2 expected improvement: 16 → 18 jobs passing (+2 jobs, ~69%)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"012ed9fe65efeb1cf95a904f9054714c3b033298","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/012ed9fe65efeb1cf95a904f9054714c3b033298"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/de993610b1761416a80432bc0ae9077f7931f942","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizati