assing with 0 TypeScript errors\n\nGitHub Actions CI/CD Setup\n- Main test workflow with 23 parallel jobs\n  - Build & type check\n  - MCP module tests\n  - Sub-agent tests (10 agents: 5 Marcus + 5 James)\n  - Integration tests (10 test suites)\n  - Agent tests\n  - Library tests\n  - Coverage reporting\n- Single test file workflow for quick validation\n- Matrix strategy for parallel execution\n- Test summary aggregation\n\nDocumentation\n- Wave 3 completion summary\n- Test remediation session summary\n- Wave 5-6 recommendations and next steps\n\nConfiguration\n- vitest.config.ts: Single thread mode for stability\n\nBuild Status: ✅ Passing (0 errors)\nTest Status: ⏳ Pending CI/CD execution\nCoverage: ⏳ Pending CI/CD execution\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d8b7ff31d278a584f52124dda84e6a4f8583e159","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/d8b7ff31d278a584f52124dda84e6a4f8583e159"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/3cf6f0d512cfd4d9cdab3a4f9a869d9ed637921c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"