failure rate).\n\n## Automation Tools Added:\n\n### 1. Method Stub Generator (`scripts/generate-method-stubs.sh`)\n- Automatically extracts methods from test files\n- Generates 238 protected method stubs across 10 sub-agents\n- Eliminates \"TypeError: method is not a function\" errors\n- 100% automated - run once to generate all stubs\n\n### 2. Increased Test Timeouts\n- Updated `vitest.config.ts`: testTimeout 5000ms → 10000ms\n- Reduces timeout-related failures\n- Provides more headroom for integration tests\n\n### 3. Comprehensive Remediation Guide\n- **docs/testing/TEST_REMEDIATION_GUIDE.md**\n- Complete workflow for fixing all 861 failures\n- Pattern detection best practices\n- Team parallelization strategy\n- Progress tracking guidelines\n\n## Generated Stub Files:\n\nThe script has generated method stubs for:\n- James sub-agents: Angular (25), Next.js (25), React (5), Svelte (29), Vue (23)\n- Marcus sub-agents: Rails (37), Java (27), Python (26), Go (22), Node (19)\n\n**Total:** 238 methods ready for implementation\n\n## Impact:\n\n**Without automation:** 40-50 hours of manual work\n**With automation:** 20-30 hours (50% reduction)\n\n**Automation potential:**\n- Phase 1 (stub generation): 100% automated ✅\n- Phase 2-4 (implementation): 30% automated (regex patterns)\n\n## Workflow:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Generate all method stubs\n./scripts/generate-method-stubs.sh\n\n# 2. Copy stubs into implementation files\ncat /tmp/stubs-marcus-rails.ts\n\n# 3. Implement pattern detection logic\n# 4. Run tests incrementally\npnpm test src/agents/opera/marcus-backend/sub-agents/marcus-rails.test.ts\n```\n\n## Estimated Timeline:\n\nWith team parallelization (3 developers):\n- **Week 1:** Implement Tier 1 agents (Rails, Next.js, Angular)\n- **Week 2:** Implement Tier 2-3 agents (remaining)\n- **Week 3:** Fix non-sub-agent failures, polish\n\n**Target:** 861 → < 20 failures (98%+ pass rate)\n\n## Status:\n\n- ✅ Automation tools created\n- ✅ Documentation complete\n- ✅ Ready to begin implementation\n- ⏳ Waiting for team assignment\n\n## Files Changed:\n\n- `vitest.config.ts` - Increased timeouts\n- `scripts/generate-method-stubs.sh` - Stub generator (executable)\n- `docs/testing/TEST_REMEDIATION_GUIDE.md` - 45-hour remediation plan\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fea8ada8b835e7f0bd4b1524cbc8ff8c2cb92809","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/fea8ada8b835e7f0bd4b1524cbc8ff8c2cb92809"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/1d63e7043fe8e230bf983ddbf0d1f738954f59e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commit/1d63e7043fe8e230bf983ddbf0d1f738954f59e9","node_id":"C_kwDOP8mr-toAKDFkNjNlNzA0M2ZlOGUyMzBiZjk4M2RkYmYwZDFmNzM4OTU0ZjU5ZTk","parent