d:\n- tests/e2e/wave-execution-e2e.test.ts (8 tests, 100% passing)\n  - Full wave plan execution with dependencies\n  - Parallel execution performance validation\n  - Multi-agent task distribution\n  - Coordination checkpoint validation\n  - Wave execution status tracking\n\n- tests/integration/wave-execution-integration.test.ts (14 tests, 100% passing)\n  - Collision detection integration\n  - Checkpoint validation integration\n  - TodoWrite event emission\n  - Time savings calculations\n  - Wave dependency resolution\n  - Error handling and recovery\n\n## Documentation Added:\n- docs/testing/WAVE_4_COVERAGE_REPORT.md\n  - Detailed coverage analysis (wave-executor: 82.83%)\n  - Coverage recommendations for remaining components\n\n- docs/testing/CI_CD_INTEGRATION.md\n  - Verified full CI/CD integration\n  - Multi-platform testing (Ubuntu, macOS, Windows)\n  - Pre-commit hooks and quality gates\n\n- docs/testing/KNOWN_TEST_FAILURES.md\n  - Tracked 861 pre-existing test failures\n  - Wave 4 status: 100% clean (22/22 tests passing)\n  - 4-8 week remediation plan for pre-existing issues\n\n## Test Results:\n- E2E Tests: 8/8 passing ✅\n- Integration Tests: 14/14 passing ✅\n- Total Wave 4 Tests: 22/22 passing (100%) ✅\n- Coverage: 82.83% (wave-executor), 77.39% (checkpoint-validator)\n- Execution Time: 146ms (fast)\n\n## Key Features Tested:\n- Wave-based parallel task execution\n- 40%+ time savings validation\n- Collision detection and auto-serialization\n- Quality gate enforcement\n- Dependency resolution\n- Checkpoint blocking vs warning behavior\n- Error handling and rollback\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4999ebe9d1ce19e9882a8d989125b706fd3ae8a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/4999ebe9d1ce19e9882a8d989125b706fd3ae8a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/73d6d05ec7a8e149f44e136b2786472dd3891510","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commit/73d6d05ec7a8e149f44e136b2786472dd3891510","node_id":"C_kwDOP8mr-toAKDczZDZkMDVlYzdhOGUxNDlmNDRlMTM2YjI3ODY0NzJkZDM4OTE1MTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commit/0f9461d4ec106b423deceab950aa089193afb7e9","sha":"0f9461d4ec106b423deceab950aa089193afb7e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/0f9461d4ec106b423deceab950aa089193afb7e9"}],"sha":"73d6d05ec7a8e149f44e136b2786472dd3891510","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/73d6d05ec7a8e149f44e136b2786472dd3891510"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/0f9461d4ec106b423deceab950aa089193afb7e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-16T21:18:18Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-16T21:18:18Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"message":"fix: Remove underscore prefixes from function parameters (fixes 836 TS build errors)\n\nFixed TypeScript build breakage caused by systematic misuse of ESLint unused variable\nconvention. Parameters were declared with underscore prefixes (e.g., _param) but referenced\nwithout underscores (e.g., param), causing \"Cannot find name\" errors.\n\n## Root Cause\n\nESLint rule ''argsIgnorePattern: ^_'' encouraged prefixing unused parameters with underscore,\nbut this created shadowing issues when parameters were referenced without the underscore.\n\nExample error pattern:\n```typescript\n// BEFORE (broken):\nfunction foo(_param: string) {\n  console.log(param);  // ❌ TS2304: Cannot find name ''param''\n}\n\n// AFTER (fixed):\nfunction foo(param: string) {\n  console.log(param);  // ✅ Works\n}\n```\n\n## Files Fixed (62+ files, 836 errors → 0)\n\nTop files by error count:\n- src/learning/pattern-learning-repository.ts (79 errors)\n- src/opera/multimodal-opera-orchestrator.ts (61 errors)\n- src/orchestration/plan-first-opera.ts (60 errors)\n- src/intelligence/adaptive-learning.ts (52 errors)\n- src/caching/intelligent-context-cache.ts (48 errors)\n- src/orchestration/parallel-task-manager.ts (44 errors)\n- [+56 more files]\n\n## Changes\n\n- Removed underscore prefixes from function/method parameter declarations\n- Removed underscore prefixes from object property declarations\n- Removed underscore prefixes from type interface properties\n- Fixed catch blocks missing error parameter declarations\n- Fixed object literal property mismatches\n\n## Verification\n\n```bash\npnpm build\n# ✅ All post-build validations passed\n# 0 TypeScript errors\n```\n\n## Impact\n\n- Build now compiles successfully\n- All TypeScript strict mode checks passing\n- Integration tests: 44/44 passing\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b729196451e4a280b4782837c5158bca9aad03c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/9b729196451e4a280b4782837c5158bca9aad03c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/0f9461d4ec106b423deceab950aa089193afb7e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commit/0f9461d4ec106b423deceab950aa089193afb7e9","node_id":"C_kwDOP8mr-toAKDBmOTQ2MWQ0ZWMxMDZiNDIzZGVjZWFiOTUwYWEwODkxOTNhZmI3ZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commit/e64a49e7d6d627414177bf19690dfb4d39497a57","sha":"e64a49e7d6d627414177bf19690dfb4d39497a57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/e64a49e7d6d627414177bf19690dfb4d39497a57"}],"sha":"0f9461d4ec106b423deceab950aa089193afb7e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/0f9461d4ec106b423deceab950aa089193afb7e9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/e64a49e7d6d627414177bf19690dfb4d39497a57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-16T21:17:55Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-16T21:17:55Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"message":"feat: Implement Wave 4 Coordination Patterns (wave execution, collision detection, checkpoints)\n\nThis commit implements the complete Wave 4 integration for parallel task execution with\nautomatic collision detection and quality gate validation.\n\n## Services Implemented\n\n### WaveExecutor (src/orchestration/wave-executor.ts)\n- Wave-based parallel execution orchestration\n- Sequential wave execution with intra-wave parallelism\n- Automatic collision detection integration\n- Checkpoint validation at wave boundaries\n- Time savings calculation (40%+ improvement)\n- Event-driven progress tracking\n\n### CollisionDetector (src/orchestration/collision-detector.ts)\n- 5-level risk assessment (NONE/LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH/CRITICAL)\n- File dependency tracking (read/modify/create/delete)\n- Auto-serialization for high-risk operations\n- Comprehensive collision reporting\n- Resolution strategy recommendations\n\n### CheckpointValidator (src/orchestration/checkpoint-validator.ts)\n- Quality gate execution via execSync\n- Blocking vs warning checkpoint modes\n- Agent handoff validation\n- Detailed validation reporting\n- Timeout and error handling\n\n## Integration Tests: 44/44 Passing\n\n- wave-execution.test.ts (12 tests)\n  - Wave structure validation\n  - Dependency checking\n  - Time savings calculation\n  - Agent distribution\n\n- collision-detection.test.ts (15 tests)\n  - All risk levels (NONE → CRITICAL)\n  - File operation conflicts\n  - Resolution strategies\n  - Edge cases\n\n- checkpoint-validation.test.ts (17 tests)\n  - Quality gate validation\n  - Blocking/warning modes\n  - Agent handoffs\n  - Error handling\n\n## Documentation\n\n- docs/guides/WAVE_EXECUTION.md (500+ lines)\n  - Complete workflow guide\n  - Time savings examples\n  - Best practices\n\n- docs/guides/COORDINATION_CHECKPOINTS.md (600+ lines)\n  - Quality gate patterns\n  - Checkpoint configuration\n  - Handoff coordination\n\n- docs/guides/CONFLICT_DETECTION.md (700+ lines)\n  - Risk assessment details\n  - Resolution strategies\n  - Troubleshooting guide\n\n## Integration\n\nUpdated .claude/commands/work.md with 130+ lines of wave execution logic:\n- Automatic collision detection before parallel execution\n- Checkpoint validation at wave boundaries\n- Blocking checkpoint enforcement\n- Progress reporting\n\n## Impact\n\n- 40%+ time savings through intelligent parallel execution\n- Automatic merge conflict prevention\n- Quality enforcement at critical transitions\n- Production-ready coordination patterns\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"955b0f1e6a53d4628f30eb559bfc3a1ad8e94b37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/955b0f1e6a53d4628f30eb559bfc3a1ad8e94b37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/e64a49e7d6d627414177bf19690dfb4d39497a57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","htm