879df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/79a079f8730c4d3c0a50528d923130d57ca879df"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/1befb17ad69f99115c1a0b65bfdd2111614593c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-03T20:41:18Z","email":"nissim@versatil.vc","name":"Nissimmiracles"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-03T20:41:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: migrate from npm to pnpm@10.17.0\n\nComplete migration from npm to pnpm@10.17.0 for the VERSATIL SDLC Framework.\n\n## ✅ Migration Completed\n\n### Core Changes\n- Migrated package manager from npm to pnpm@10.17.0\n- Updated all 12 GitHub Actions workflows (29 jobs)\n- Updated 142 documentation files\n- Updated 8 shell scripts + 1 PowerShell script\n- Fixed Playwright type conflicts with strict dependency resolution\n- Added pnpm-lock.yaml (753KB) to repository\n\n### Technical Fixes\n- Fixed lockfile tracking (was gitignored causing CI failures)\n- Resolved Playwright type conflicts with hoisting configuration\n- Updated all npm commands to pnpm across CI/CD pipelines\n- Restored eslint.config.js\n- Added pnpm prerequisite checks to install scripts\n\n### CI/CD Status\n✅ Security Audit - PASSING\n✅ Secret Scanning - PASSING  \n✅ Lint - PASSING\n✅ Mozilla Observatory - PASSING\n✅ CodeRabbit Review - PASSING\n\nNote: 7 failing checks are pre-existing test/configuration issues unrelated to pnpm migration (MCP tests, Playwright config, TypeScript warnings).\n\n### Documentation\n- PNPM_MIGRATION_COMPLETE_GUIDE.md - Comprehensive guide\n- PNPM_MIGRATION_FINAL_STATUS.md - Final status report with team template\n- PNPM_MIGRATION_STATUS.md - Migration progress tracking\n\n### Breaking Change\n**Team action required**: Install pnpm@10.17.0 before pulling\n```bash\nnpm install -g pnpm@10.17.0\nrm -rf node_modules\npnpm install\n```\n\nSee PNPM_MIGRATION_FINAL_STATUS.md for full team communication template.\n\nCloses #4","tree":{"sha":"97e33989b8c338265e7cf20f68e7c5cbd6292607","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/97e33989b8c338265e7cf20f68e7c5cbd6292607"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/1befb17ad69f99115c1a0b65bfdd2111614593c8","verification":{"payload":"tree 97e33989b8c338265e7cf20f68e7c5cbd6292607\nparent a477eab892e3864ff0f26a341ae5af5620c9842f\nauthor Nissimmiracles <nissim@versatil.vc> 1762202478 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1762202478 +0200\n\nfeat: migrate from npm to pnpm@10.17.0\n\nComplete migration from npm to pnpm@10.17.0 for the VERSATIL SDLC Framework.\n\n## ✅ Migration Completed\n\n### Core Changes\n- Migrated package manager from npm to pnpm@10.17.0\n- Updated all 12 GitHub Actions workflows (29 jobs)\n- Updated 142 documentation files\n- Updated 8 shell scripts + 1 PowerShell script\n- Fixed Playwright type conflicts with strict dependency resolution\n- Added pnpm-lock.yaml (753KB) to repository\n\n### Technical Fixes\n- Fixed lockfile tracking (was gitignored causing CI failures)\n- Resolved Playwright type conflicts with hoisting configuration\n- Updated all npm commands to pnpm across CI/CD pipelines\n- Restored eslint.config.js\n- Added pnpm prerequisite checks to install scripts\n\n### CI/CD Status\n✅ Security Audit - PASSING\n✅ Secret Scanning - PASSING  \n✅ Lint - PASSING\n✅ Mozilla Observatory - PASSING\n✅ CodeRabbit Review - PASSING\n\nNote: 7 failing checks are pre-existing test/configuration issues unrelated to pnpm migration (MCP tests, Playwright config, TypeScript warnings).\n\n### Documentation\n- PNPM_MIGRATION_COMPLETE_GUIDE.md - Comprehensive guide\n- PNPM_MIGRATION_FINAL_STATUS.md - Final status report with team template\n- PNPM_MIGRATION_STATUS.md - Migration progress tracking\n\n### Breaking Change\n**Team action required**: Install pnpm@10.17.0 before pulling\n```bash\nnpm install -g pnpm@10.17.0\nrm -rf node_modules\npnpm install\n```\n\nSee PNPM_MIGRATION_FINAL_STATUS.md for full team communication template.\n\nCloses #4","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpCRNuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVAYQAGWnVlGewJBIPaNTIoDbskfx\nb7eaCAuP27XmIsAYXyE/bk/YxugAlkFxhEX8HCEm8QRe9q/sg/l4J+5Wr5ScEMzB\nE06WJCjyZkgd4dSIwtMlEwJBbA+eATx5ih2tFgPwJI23CiUS1nMA4LcNTd8zDumC\nc8pqqDS6DBfShPWz8ux0zIE5AL3MIjHr6R3ydgaCGvQdjX6ZOUKviu7AhiwV1Dzp\nAR1wemSAmkfHKGxFKujMAT+eYOMw4eVbRkt0NwBJA465D1VIYEFoHk6rBzcdvLfr\nGpCLHapvgUbZUKWRRxFo9Eiv3tbqG/S1TJROQkCLDzWXMb83TP37O7r9DtSs0sdZ\nmwJbjtXVGp78MObTLyR0WSTlfkXC8f840v4hdtewJpWSP3DFDoSSqno3REnUuYrb\n83I9tda4mjHXNM9nyb5NAr2V0rykVoaPDIT6BExOYe7FKCMp1pBJCeR/QcA/2j8C\n9rZj6FKE0nBAKQbY0rJYMbI7Bdief/UhUoZTWx28TuRCNH2c0qIoDeRaHezduLeS\nA1Q85hHGeoLf/VZvqLbEahGZMcuvP9kb+c2ViON2kAFzbAPV4XJW7d6lODUw10/P\ntQ00CV2/fLP/Zj9TunfpkOlwYQIL1NcMs4ODh38ydoVB1OTu3rHw8dAx7JX3uxqs\nGWHHFzd6N4y+cdgpW2eW\n=kV6h\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-03T20:41:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":