    * created_by, created_at, framework_version\n     * auto_generated flag\n     * Note: ''Safe to delete - framework will use bundled defaults''\n     * Docs link for reference\n   - Helps users understand auto-created files\n\n3. **Configuration Documentation** (NPX_INSTALLATION.md:286-379)\n   - New \"Configuration File Management\" section\n   - Explains where config lives (framework vs user project)\n   - Documents auto-creation behavior\n   - Shows custom configuration options\n   - Explains Guardian security model\n\n**Why v7.16.1 Security is CORRECT:**\n\nThe allowlist rules with `user_project_scope` actually provide proper isolation:\n- ✅ Allows creation in user''s own project\n- ❌ Blocks framework directory modifications\n- ❌ Blocks system directory access\n- ✅ Zero Trust architecture maintained\n\n**Version**: 7.16.1 → 7.16.2","tree":{"sha":"8010b45df9d6486b8c82f06cde2190b17b60b0ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/8010b45df9d6486b8c82f06cde2190b17b60b0ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/18df77c8c033fe67ca60b82c76ea8c4b8cf7d74b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos",