:\n\n1. **docs/COMPARISON.md**\n   - Updated migration guides (Copilot/Cursor/Claude SDK)\n   - Changed npm install → npx commands\n\n2. **docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md**\n   - Updated version: 7.9.0 → 7.16.1\n   - Added note about npx vs npm install\n   - Updated \"Framework Not Installed\" → \"MCP Server Not Running\"\n   - Updated key troubleshooting commands\n\n3. **docs/TUTORIALS.md**\n   - Updated prerequisites to use npx\n   - Removed npm install references\n\n4. **docs/USER_COHERENCE_GUIDE.md**\n   - Updated version: 7.9.0 → 7.16.1\n   - Added note about npx-based MCP servers\n   - Updated health check actions for npx\n\n**Remaining files** (16 total with npm install):\n- Mostly old release notes and archived docs\n- Can be updated incrementally as touched\n- Core user-facing docs now correct\n\nPhase 3 properly completed!","tree":{"sha":"d34ab2dc8779e747fd98d5a3983c488037078074","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/d34ab2dc8779e747fd98d5a3983c488037078074"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/b38d1c4ab6dd1336e4a0ad0d966727dd50f866fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos","site_admin":