l/versatil-maestro/commits/72bd148c73387bee953f85822609d8e8b714d3ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-31T14:31:57Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-31T14:31:57Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"message":"docs: Simplify to npx-only installation (v7.16.1)\n\n**BREAKING CHANGE**: Removed npm registry installation instructions\n\n**Why npx-only:**\n- Package not published to npm (last: v7.10.2, current: v7.16.1)\n- npm install from GitHub too slow (10-15 min vs 2-3 min npx)\n- npx perfect for MCP server use case\n- No project dependency pollution\n- Always uses latest GitHub release\n\n**Changes:**\n\n1. **README.md**\n   - Replaced `npm install` with npx command\n   - Updated Quick Start section\n   - Updated Installation section with npx-first approach\n   - Added Claude Desktop config example\n\n2. **docs/INSTALLATION.md**\n   - Reorganized into 3 clear paths:\n     * Path 1: npx (Recommended - MCP Server)\n     * Path 2: Development Setup (git clone)\n     * Path 3: Global CLI Installation (npm link)\n   - Removed npm registry instructions\n   - Added version pinning examples\n   - Updated all config examples to use npx\n\n3. **docs/guides/NPX_INSTALLATION.md** (NEW)\n   - Complete npx installation guide\n   - Why npx vs npm install comparison\n   - Version management (pin to tag/commit/main)\n   - Cache management\n   - Troubleshooting guide\n   - Performance benchmarks\n   - FAQ section\n\n4. **package.json**\n   - Added `\"preferGlobal\": false`\n   - Engines already set: node >=18.0.0, npm >=9.0.0\n\n**Installation Methods Comparison:**\n\n| Method | Time | Use Case |\n|--------|------|----------|\n| ✅ npx (recommended) | 2-3 min | MCP servers |\n| ⚠️ npm install (GitHub) | 10-15 min | Removed (too slow) |\n| 🛠️ git clone + npm install | 12-18 min | Development only |\n\n**Next Steps:**\n- Phase 3: Update other docs (~10-15 files) - deferred\n- Can be done incrementally as files are touched\n\nVersion: 7.16.1","tree":{"sha":"4e09dd877c76ef4790fb18f15b1da3d9397a6c23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/4e09dd877c76ef4790fb18f15b1da3d9397a6c23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/72bd148c73387bee953f85822609d8e8b714d3ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commit/72bd148c73387bee953f85822609d8e8b714d3ba","node_id":"C_kwDOP8mr-toAKDcyYmQxNDhjNzMzODdiZWU5NTNmODU4MjI2MDlkOGU4YjcxNGQzYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commit/8d8ff994bb023cb375dd5d1094ab6035c65f15cc","sha":"8d8ff994bb023cb375dd5d1094ab6035c65f15cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/8d8ff994bb023cb375dd5d1094ab6035c65f15cc"}],"sha":"72bd148c73387bee953f85822609d8e8b714d3ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/72bd148c73387bee953f85822609d8e8b714d3ba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/8d8ff994bb023cb375dd5d1094ab6035c65f15cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-31T14:16:52Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-31T14:16:52Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"message":"fix(v7.16.1): Critical hotfix for npx installation\n\n**CRITICAL BUGS FIXED:**\n1. ProfileManager path resolution - now uses import.meta.url\n2. Boundary Engine blocking user config files - added high-priority allowlist\n3. Auto-creates default config if missing in user project\n\n**ProfileManager Changes (profile-manager.ts):**\n- Added getFrameworkRoot() using import.meta.url (finds actual installation dir)\n- Constructor now searches: framework dir → user project → process.cwd()\n- Added createDefaultProfileConfig() for automatic setup\n- Added isInUserProjectScope() helper for path validation\n\n**Boundary Engine Changes (boundary-enforcement-engine.ts):**\n- Added 3 new allowlist rules (priority 10):\n  * Allow .env/.env.local in user projects\n  * Allow mcp-profiles.config.json in user projects\n  * Allow package.json in user projects\n- Increased MCP log file priority from 1 → 10\n- Added isInUserProjectScope() condition evaluator\n\n**Impact:**\n- ✅ npx installation now works correctly\n- ✅ Profile system loads from framework installation\n- ✅ Users can create config files in their projects\n- ✅ Fixes \"falling back to legacy registration\" error\n- ✅ Restores v7.16.0 performance (32 tools, <10ms startup)\n\nVersion: 7.16.0 → 7.16.1","tree":{"sha":"5637c89b78c37c47caf537a99eba3c5c35f7e8f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/5637c89b78c37c47caf537a99eba3c5c35f7e8f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/8d8ff994bb023cb375dd5d1094ab6035c65f15cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/starred{/owne