9?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/c44781f1785b1748eca2f39ef355878e50c447af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-28T22:27:09Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-28T22:27:09Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"message":"fix(build): Include dist/ in repository for git-based installations\n\nCRITICAL FIX: Users installing via git URL had no compiled code\n\n**Problem**:\n- dist/ was gitignored AND npmignored\n- Users installing via ''git+https://...'' got source TypeScript only\n- Framework unusable without compiled JavaScript\n- /update command couldn''t run (dist/update/github-release-checker.js missing)\n\n**Solution**:\n1. Remove dist/ from .gitignore (now committed to repo)\n2. Remove dist/ from .npmignore (included in npm packages)\n3. Added 1,313 compiled files to repository\n\n**Why Commit Compiled Code?**:\n- Users install via git URL (not npm)\n- Git clones don''t run build scripts\n- npm postinstall can''t compile without devDependencies\n- Alternative: Users would need to manually run ''npm install && npm run build''\n\n**Trade-offs**:\n- ✅ Users get working code immediately after git clone\n- ✅ /update command works (has compiled GitHubReleaseChecker)\n- ✅ No build step required for users\n- ⚠️  Repo size increases (~5-10 MB)\n- ⚠️  Must rebuild before each release (npm run build)\n\n**Files Changed**:\n- .gitignore: Removed dist/ exclusion (commented with reasoning)\n- .npmignore: Removed dist/ exclusion (commented with reasoning)\n- dist/**/*.{js,d.ts,js.map}: 1,313 compiled files added\n\n**Impact**:\n- ✅ v7.10.1 now includes working /update command\n- ✅ GitHub repo owner fix (Nissimmiracles) is in compiled code\n- ✅ Users can install and use framework immediately","tree":{"sha":"84f851ea5272d9baf6c4cc91c4d17846d2d16f5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/84f851ea5272d9baf6c4cc91c4d17846d2d16f5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/c44781f1785b1748eca2f39ef355878e50c447af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissim