epository\n\n**Problem**:\n- GitHubReleaseChecker defaulted to ''MiraclesGIT'' (non-existent)\n- Actual repo owner is ''Nissimmiracles''\n- Result: /update couldn''t find v7.10.0 release\n\n**Solution**:\n- Updated default repoOwner to ''Nissimmiracles''\n- Source: src/update/github-release-checker.ts\n- Compiled: dist/update/github-release-checker.js (updated manually, gitignored)\n\n**Impact**:\n- /update will now correctly detect v7.10.0 as latest\n- Users can update from v7.9.0 → v7.10.0\n- Release URL: https://github.com/Nissimmiracles/versatil-sdlc-framework/releases/tag/v7.10.0","tree":{"sha":"ae93301a4ba424a4d87f67ca3aa4fc934d869485","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/ae93301a4ba424a4d87f67ca3aa4fc934d869485"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/e10aeef20592a761cad798969d6c40b302f98688","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles","user_view