tion now enabled by default\n- Smart grouping reduces TODO spam by 5-10x (10 issues → 2 files)\n- Group by agent, priority, or layer (configurable)\n- Three-layer anti-duplication system\n- Auto-apply detection for high-confidence issues (≥90%)\n- Comprehensive documentation (551-line guide)\n\nNew Environment Variables:\n- GUARDIAN_CREATE_TODOS=true (default: enabled)\n- GUARDIAN_GROUP_TODOS=true (group related issues)\n- GUARDIAN_GROUP_BY=agent (grouping strategy)\n- GUARDIAN_MAX_ISSUES_PER_TODO=10 (max per file)\n\nDocumentation:\n- Added: docs/guardian/GUARDIAN_TODO_SYSTEM.md\n- Updated: CLAUDE.md (Guardian TODO section)\n\nArchitecture Improvements (from previous work):\n- Added: docs/architecture/ARCHITECTURE_QUICK_REFERENCE.md\n- Added: docs/architecture/PARALLELIZATION_VS_SPECIALIZATION.md\n- Added: docs/architecture/SKILLS_VS_SUBAGENTS_COMPARISON.md\n- Added: docs/architecture/diagrams/ (4 Mermaid diagrams)\n- Added: docs/comparisons/VERSATIL_VS_CLAUDE_SDK_CURSOR.md\n\nSkills Added:\n- health-monitoring (Guardian health check system)\n- version-management (semantic versioning and releases)\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: GUARDIAN_CREATE_TODOS now defaults to true (was false in v7.7.0).\nUsers preferring telemetry-only tracking: set GUARDIAN_CREATE_TODOS=false","tree":{"sha":"1426f26c788597062ea3d16d38111e85b029edf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/1426f26c788597062ea3d16d38111e85b029edf2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/9b99bf8b648e4708b41205b59db5f34e89721ce9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_us