ormance, edge cases\n\n## Impact\n- Pattern library: 54 → 59 patterns (+9.3%)\n- Annual time savings: 135-220 hours/year (combined v7.3.0 + v7.5.0)\n- Test coverage: Maintained at 96%+ overall\n- Pattern success rates: 89-96%\n\n## Files Changed\n- NEW: 5 pattern files (templates/patterns/*.json)\n- NEW: scripts/telemetry-report.cjs\n- NEW: docs/v7.5.0_RELEASE_NOTES.md\n- NEW: docs/TELEMETRY_INSIGHTS.md\n- MODIFIED: tests/unit/templates/template-matcher.test.ts (+291 lines)\n- MODIFIED: src/telemetry/automation-metrics.ts (+200 lines analytics)\n- MODIFIED: package.json (7.4.0 → 7.5.0, +3 scripts)\n- MODIFIED: CHANGELOG.md (v7.5.0 entry)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e3958e47c7c0dc503624f3c5b54a609f38515cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/2e3958e47c7c0dc503624f3c5b54a609f38515cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/ff042f3ba00faa45f5d8ee83aaed008e00a7020a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/starred{/o