, 6 pre-built templates, keyword scoring\n\n**Token Savings (MEDIUM priority):**\n- Before: 253 lines × ~5 tokens/line = ~1,265 tokens\n- After: ~150 tokens (notification + skill metadata)\n- Savings: ~1,115 tokens (88.1% reduction)\n\n**Cumulative Savings (HIGH + MEDIUM):**\n- Before: 1,734 lines = ~8,670 tokens\n- After: ~550 tokens\n- Total savings: ~8,120 tokens (93.7% reduction)\n\n**Testing:**\n✅ Triple library detection (planning, mcp, templates) - 150 tokens output\n✅ Hook integration working correctly\n✅ Consistent When/What/How structure maintained\n\n**Next:** Phase 3 LOW priority (8 libraries: dashboard, memory, validation, learning, intelligence, context, ui, hooks)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"31945d43fa9cb090297ad972f77da82762ac6788","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/31945d43fa9cb090297ad972f77da82762ac6788"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/14069b7cb5b507bad0c9786ede03f3020b2b1c16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_cUeQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.