public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/fedc84e9602865c31e8fcd1fd401f06fb342d89a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T19:29:03Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T19:29:03Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"message":"chore(repo): Organize repository structure for marketplace readiness\n\nReduced root directory from 55+ items to ~15 essential files by organizing into logical directories:\n\n✅ Configuration Management\n  - Moved jest configs, playwright config, tsconfig.test.json, mcp.json, claude-desktop-config.json → config/\n  - Centralized all framework configuration files\n\n✅ Scripts Organization\n  - Moved install-mcp.sh, install-versatil-mcp.sh, rebrand-to-opera.sh, test-all-key-scripts.sh → scripts/\n  - All executable scripts in one location\n\n✅ Test Organization\n  - Moved test-native-hooks.cjs, test-sdk-simple.cjs, test-parallel-quick.js → tests/demo/\n  - Moved test-mcp-integration.ts, test-sdk-agents.ts, test-sdk-parallel.ts → tests/integration/\n  - Moved example.test.ts → tests/\n  - Added npm script: \"demo:native\": \"node tests/demo/test-native-hooks.cjs\"\n\n✅ Build Artifacts\n  - Moved index.d.ts, index.d.ts.map → build/\n  - All TypeScript build outputs in one location\n\n✅ Deployment Files\n  - Moved Dockerfile, docker/, helm/ → deployment/\n  - Centralized all deployment configurations\n\n✅ Changelog Management\n  - Moved CHANGELOG_v6.6.0.md → changelogs/\n  - Historical changelogs organized separately\n\n✅ Documentation Updates\n  - Updated 6 documentation files with new demo path (test-native-hooks.cjs → npm run demo:native)\n  - Updated .claude-plugin/marketplace.json quickStart.verify path\n  - Updated .claude-plugin/plugin.json quickStart.verify path\n  - Updated docs/MARKETPLACE_SUBMISSION.md (4 references)\n  - Updated docs/testing/NATIVE_VS_NON_NATIVE_DEMO.md (2 references)\n  - Updated docs/comparisons/VERSATIL_VS_EVERY_COMPOUNDING_ENGINEERING.md\n\n✅ Cleanup\n  - Removed outdated session summaries and temporary files (50+ files deleted)\n  - Removed duplicate README.md.v6.6.0\n  - Removed build/test output files (build-output.txt, coverage-output.txt, etc.)\n  - Removed test report JSON/HTML files\n\n✅ Test Script Fix\n  - Updated test-native-hooks.cjs to use projectRoot instead of __dirname\n  - Script now works correctly from tests/demo/ location\n  - Demo verified: npm run demo:native works as expected\n\nBenefits:\n  - Cleaner GitHub repository homepage (professional appearance)\n  - Better developer onboarding (clear file organization)\n  - Marketplace-ready structure (follows best practices)\n  - Easier maintenance (logical grouping)\n  - Improved npm package distribution (organized file array)\n\nFiles moved: 25+ files reorganized\nDocumentation updated: 6 files\nNew npm script: demo:native\nRoot directory reduced: 55+ items → ~15 items\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d1b3bc0e8273c385503ca2a556d53bac21e39a78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/d1b3bc0e8273c385503ca2a556d53bac21e39a78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/fedc84e9602865c31e8fcd1fd401f06fb342d89a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","n