rred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/1b6f5c74cafcc3c9986e473b44967f81af6a4dd7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T19:07:35Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T19:07:35Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"message":"feat(marketplace): Claude Code marketplace submission ready v6.6.0\n\nMARKETPLACE-READY PLUGIN PACKAGE\n\nPlugin Manifest Updates:\n✅ .claude-plugin/plugin.json (v6.6.0)\n  - Updated to v6.6.0 with latest features\n  - 21 specialized OPERA agents listed\n  - 6 native SDK hooks documented\n  - Highlights: native SDK, compounding engineering, anti-hallucination\n  - Keywords optimized for marketplace discovery\n  - Component listing (agents + hooks)\n\nMarketplace Listing:\n✅ .claude-plugin/marketplace.json (v6.6.0)\n  - Updated plugin entry to v6.6.0\n  - Enhanced categories (native-sdk, compounding-engineering, anti-hallucination)\n  - Updated tags (victor-verifier, assessment-engine, codify-phase, etc.)\n  - Features showcase (13 key highlights)\n  - Quick start instructions\n  - Maintainer info updated\n\nSubmission Guide:\n✅ docs/MARKETPLACE_SUBMISSION.md (432 lines)\n  - Complete marketplace submission guide\n  - Installation methods (marketplace, GitHub, npm)\n  - Verification steps and checklists\n  - Manifest details and structure\n  - Quick start for users\n  - Documentation links\n  - Readiness checklist (all items ✅)\n  - Submission steps\n  - Competitive advantages\n  - Future roadmap\n\nKey Features Highlighted:\n  ✅ 100% Native Claude SDK Integration (first framework)\n  ✅ 21 Specialized Agents (8 core + 10 sub + 3 enhanced)\n  ✅ Victor-Verifier Anti-Hallucination System\n  ✅ Assessment Engine Phase 1 (pattern detection)\n  ✅ Automatic Compounding Engineering (CODIFY via Stop hook)\n  ✅ 6 Native SDK Hooks (TypeScript auto-activation)\n  ✅ Works in Claude Code + Cursor (zero config)\n  ✅ 2.5x faster by Feature 5 (automatic pattern reuse)\n  ✅ Zero manual commands required\n\nInstallation Methods:\n  1. Claude Code Marketplace: /plugin install versatil-opera-framework\n  2. Direct GitHub Clone: git clone https://github.com/Nissimmiracles/versatil-sdlc-framework.git\n  3. npm (future): npm install -g @versatil/opera-framework\n\nVerification:\n  • No custom YAML fields (all SDK-supported)\n  • All 4 SDK hooks configured\n  • All 6 hooks executable TypeScript\n  • Interactive demo: node test-native-hooks.cjs\n\nStatus: ✅ MARKETPLACE READY\n\nNext Steps:\n  1. Create GitHub release (v6.6.0)\n  2. Submit to Claude Code marketplace\n  3. Share in community marketplaces\n  4. Marketing (blog, social media, HN)\n\nFiles: 3 files updated/created, 558 lines added\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58231c4420f83beb5482aaa743e6145a7fdde819","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/58231c4420f83beb5482aaa743e6145a7fdde819"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/1b6f5c74cafcc3c9986e473b44967f81af6a4dd7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id":200742009,"login":"Nissimmiracles","node_id":"U_kgDOC_