ps://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/commits/22c2ce2cc62f429e813430df6f5e0f493cdba1a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-22T18:45:42Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-22T18:45:42Z","email":"nissim@verss.ai","name":"MiraclesGIT"},"message":"feat(victor): Assessment Engine Phase 1 - Quality auditing beyond verification\n\nCRITICAL DISTINCTION:\n- Verification: \"Did it happen?\" (file exists, command ran)\n- Assessment: \"Does it meet quality standards?\" (coverage ≥80%, no vulnerabilities)\n\nIndustry research (2025): \"Before trusting AI agent work, auditors must conduct\nquality checks just as they would with a junior team member.\"\n\nFeatures:\n✅ Assessment Engine (415 lines)\n  - Pattern detection: security, api, ui, test, database\n  - Assessment planning: which tools, thresholds, priorities\n  - Configuration system with fallback defaults\n  - Tool execution framework (Phase 2 ready)\n\n✅ Assessment Configuration\n  - 5 pattern categories (71 keywords total)\n  - 8 assessment tools (semgrep, jest, lighthouse, axe-core, eslint, api-linter, bandit, safety)\n  - Configurable thresholds (80% coverage, 0 vulnerabilities, 90+ performance)\n  - Priority levels (critical, high, medium, low)\n\n✅ Victor Hook Integration\n  - AssessmentEngine integrated after verification\n  - Logs assessment plans to .versatil/verification/assessment-plans.jsonl\n  - Shows priority, assessments, estimated duration\n  - Next steps guidance (Phase 2, Phase 3)\n\n✅ Victor Documentation\n  - Added \"Verification vs Assessment\" section\n  - Added Assessment Engine (Phase 1) responsibility\n  - Added Example 4: Assessment Detection output\n  - Added Assessment Configuration reference\n\nPattern Examples:\n  Security (CRITICAL): auth, login, password, token, jwt → semgrep + 90% coverage\n  API (HIGH): route, endpoint, controller, REST → semgrep + 80% coverage + API lint\n  UI (HIGH): component, jsx, react, button → accessibility + performance + 75% coverage\n  Database (CRITICAL): migration, schema, sql, RLS → semgrep + 85% coverage\n\nOutput Example:\n  🔍 Victor: ✓ VERIFIED (100% confidence)\n  🔬 Assessment Engine: 🚨 ASSESSMENT REQUIRED (Priority: CRITICAL)\n     Reason: Security-sensitive code detected\n     Assessments: Security (semgrep) [MANDATORY], TestCoverage (jest) [MANDATORY]\n     Next: Phase 2 auto-execute via Marcus-Backend\n\nPhase 1: ✅ COMPLETE - Detection and planning\nPhase 2: Auto-execute via Maria-QA/Marcus/James\nPhase 3: Block merges if mandatory assessments fail\n\nTesting: All 8 configuration tests passed\nDocumentation: docs/ASSESSMENT_ENGINE_IMPLEMENTATION.md (complete guide)\n\nFiles: 1,254 lines added (5 files)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ae5e8f28a30168c3a3de6d39595eda67916a94b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/trees/1ae5e8f28a30168c3a3de6d39595eda67916a94b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VERSATIL-official/versatil-maestro/git/commits/22c2ce2cc62f429e813430df6f5e0f493cdba1a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/200742009?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nissimmiracles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nissimmiracles","id