oadWebChunk (async) in web, loadChunk in node\n- Activation: providerInit/fileDateProviderImplExport/fileDateProviderImpl\n  loaded via _loadWebChunk in web mode (not sync loadChunk which returns null)\n- test-web-bundle-smoke: enable freshnessAllowVirtualFs for vscode-vfs mock URIs\n- test-bundle: update size thresholds to match module-federation architecture\n  (core bundle ~250KB, VSIX ~860KB with all chunks bundled)\n\nAll 5 web chunks (loggerImpl, providerInit, onboarding, analysis,\nruntimeManagement) now load successfully in web mode. File decoration\nprovider created, registered, and hydrated. All 44 commands registered.\n\nSmoke test output:\n  badge:\"~~\", hasColor:true, color:\"charts.red\", freshnessSource:\"fs\"\n  Provider: created:true, registered:true, hydrated:true","tree":{"sha":"0acd460b596f96635cf9c47c32420eb40ea134b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/incredincomp/explorer-dates/git/trees/0acd460b596f96635cf9c47c32420eb40ea134b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/incredincomp/explorer-dates/git/commits/89b7722916cca7220e1989d733ac1bcbede61581","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43874843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/incredincomp","id":43874843,"login":"incredincomp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODc0ODQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/starre