"email":"incredincomp@gmail.com","name":"incredincomp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-27T17:05:56Z","email":"incredincomp@gmail.com","name":"incredincomp"},"message":"Fix: INVALID decoration badge in extensionApi — formatDate produced >2 char strings\n\nextensionApi.getDecorationForFile() was using this.formatDate(date, ''smart'')\nfor the badge property, which returns strings like ''Jan 5'' or ''2 days'' —\nfar exceeding VS Code''s 2-codepoint badge limit.\n\nFix: compute the age bucket (now/today/2d/1w/stale) and call formatBadge()\nfrom freshnessResolver to get the same ≤2-char symbols (npm run package T 2d 1w ~~) that\nthe main decoration provider uses.\n\nAlso fix the example plugin''s badge concatenation (`${badge} • ${size}`)\nwhich would also exceed the limit — keep the existing badge, put size in tooltip.\n\nThis resolves the INVALID decoration warnings seen in the extension host log.","tree":{"sha":"f8e15bfe44d80b7f72b55bd42535bda76c0d94f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/incredincomp/explorer-dates/git/trees/f8e15bfe44d80b7f72b55bd42535bda76c0d94f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/incredincomp/explorer-dates/git/commits/f06b62b6966675e9f1827089bf17055d5570074e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43874843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/incredincomp","id":43874843,"login":"incredincomp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODc0ODQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/incredincomp/explorer-dates/commit/f06b62b6966675e9f1827089bf17055d5570074e","node_id":"C_kwDOP83QydoAKGYwNmI2MmI2OTY2Njc1ZTlmMTgyNzA4OWJmMTcwNTVkNTU3MDA3NGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/incredincomp/explorer-dates/commit/a19421fbf040f7955a49eb0ab8a4a6f64d8314aa","sha":"a19421fbf040f7955a49eb0ab8a4a6f64d8314aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/incredincomp/explorer-dates/commits/a19421fbf040f7955a49eb0ab8a4a6f64d8314aa"}],"sha":"f06b62b6966675e9f1827089bf17055d5570074e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/incredincomp/explorer-dates/commits/f06b62b6966675e9f1827089bf17055d5570074e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43874843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/incredincomp","id":43874843,"login":"incredincomp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODc0ODQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/incredincomp/explorer-dates/commits/a19421fbf040f7955a49eb0ab8a4a6f64d8314aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-27T16:30:52Z","email":"incredincomp@gmail.com","name":"incredincomp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-27T16:34:25Z","email":"incredincomp@gmail.com","name":"incredincomp"},"message":"Fix: convert isWebEnvironment IIFE boolean to function — prevents ''not a function'' crash in web\n\nThe root cause of the TypeError was that extension.js defined isWebEnvironment\nas a boolean IIFE result:\n  const isWebEnvironment = (() => { ... })();\n\nIn the web bundle, esbuild preserved this as an IIFE that evaluated to true at\nruntime (because typeof process !== ''undefined'' is true in the VS Code web\nextension host). Any call isWebEnvironment() then became true(), which threw\nTypeError: isWebEnvironment is not a function.\n\nFix: convert to an arrow function (remove trailing () invocation):\n  const isWebEnvironment = () => { ... };\n\nAll 13 call sites in extension.js updated from bare boolean references to\nfunction calls (isWebEnvironment -> isWebEnvironment()). The web bundle now\ncorrectly assigns the function reference via __name(), making all 16\nisWebEnvironment() calls in the bundle valid.","tree":{"sha":"fc8a2ccd298a34b7dfc4983c920a084111c1fa49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/incredincomp/explorer-dates/git/trees/fc8a2ccd298a34b7dfc4983c920a084111c1fa49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/incredincomp/explorer-dates/git/commits/a19421fbf040f7955a49eb0ab8a4a6f64d8314aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43874843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/incredincomp","id":43874843,"login":"incredincomp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODc0ODQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/incredincomp/explorer-dates/commit/a19421fbf040f7955a49eb0ab8a4a6f64d8314aa","node_id":"C_kwDOP83QydoAKGExOTQyMWZiZjA0MGY3OTU1YTQ5ZWIwYWI4YTRhNmY2NGQ4MzE0YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/incredincomp/explorer-dates/commit/47e7516d9533f3c7639e8da870a71ddf82afa15f","sha":"47e7516d9533f3c7639e8da870a71ddf82afa15f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/incredincomp/explorer-dates/commits/47e7516d9533f3c7639e8da870a71ddf82afa15f"}],"sha":"a19421fbf040f7955a49eb0ab8a4a6f64d8314aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/incredincomp/explorer-dates/commits/a19421fbf040f7955a49eb0ab8a4a6f64d8314aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43874843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/incredincomp","id":43874843,"login":"incredincomp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzODc0ODQz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/repos","site_a