df013dc8084f565323e061761fcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-27T07:16:52Z","email":"incredincomp@gmail.com","name":"incredincomp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-27T07:16:52Z","email":"incredincomp@gmail.com","name":"incredincomp"},"message":"Fix: enforce VS Code 2-char badge limit; source labels move to tooltip\n\nVS Code''s FileDecoration.badge silently drops any string longer than\n2 Unicode codepoints. All previous bucket labels violated this:\n  ''now'' (3), ''today'' (5), ''stale'' (5), ''2d • Git'' (8), etc.\n\nChanges:\n- Add formatBadgeAge() returning ≤2-char labels:\n    now → ''!!''  today → ''T''  2d → ''2d''  1w → ''1w''  stale → ''~~''\n- formatBadge() uses formatBadgeAge(); source text removed from badge\n- badge.sourceLabelMode now controls tooltip source-line visibility\n  (never=suppress, auto=non-normal cases, always=always show)\n- Remove formatSourceBadgeLabel() export; add formatBadgeAge() export\n- Update package.json setting description to reflect tooltip behaviour\n- Rewrite badge formatting tests: 15 cases including exhaustive\n  length guard across all bucket×source×confidence×mode combos","tree":{"sha":"d03b6604df1a6abcf1a5d2bfe48d182fd0280f1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/incredincomp/explorer-dates/git/trees/d03b6604df1a6abcf1a5d2bfe48d182fd0280f1f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/incredincomp/explorer-dates/git/commits/f2d913697121df013dc8084f565323e061761fcd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43874843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/incredincomp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/incredinco