risrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/85ba7e5975bdaf2bc6c54db251d9d52c46dad155/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-04T10:40:14Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-04T10:40:14Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"feat: add PAN Invoice Studio demo app\n\nComplete professional invoice creator built with PAN patterns.\n\nFeatures:\n- Contenteditable UX with dotted borders for fluid editing\n- Auto-calculations for line items, tax, and totals\n- IndexedDB storage for local-first, offline-capable operation\n- Contact management with picker modal\n- Invoice browser with search/filter/sort\n- Import/export JSON for data backup/restore\n- PDF export using jsPDF\n- Mobile-responsive design\n- Toast notifications for user feedback\n- Auto-save with debouncing\n\nComponents:\n- pan-invoice-toolbar: Action buttons for all operations\n- pan-invoice-editor: Main invoice layout with contenteditable fields\n- pan-invoice-line-items: Editable table with automatic calculations\n- pan-contact-manager: Modal dialog for contact management\n- pan-invoice-browser: Modal dialog for browsing past invoices\n- pan-toast: Toast notifications\n\nServices:\n- invoice-db.mjs: IndexedDB wrapper for data persistence\n- data-handler.mjs: Import/export and PDF generation\n\nPAN Message Topics:\n- invoice.*: Invoice operations (new, save, load, state)\n- invoice.items.*: Line item operations\n- contacts.*: Contact management\n- invoice.data.*: Import/export operations\n- invoice.export.pdf: PDF generation\n- ui.toast.show: User notifications\n\nThis demonstrates:\n✅ Real-world PAN application\n✅ Component composition via messages\n✅ Modal dialogs without prop drilling\n✅ Local-first architecture\n✅ ContentEditable integration\n✅ Complex state management\n✅ Auto-save patterns\n✅ Mobile-responsive design\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6f3f44509c1a384d86d323d92bfab1ba8727fb5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/trees/6f3f44509c1a384d86d323d92bfab1ba8727fb5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/commits/85ba7e5975bdaf2bc6c54db251d9d52c46dad155","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https