 Deprecation timeline (2 MINOR versions or 6 months minimum)\n  - Migration guide requirements for v2.0\n\nThis contract is now IMMUTABLE for all v1.x releases. Breaking changes\nrequire v2.0 and proper deprecation period.\n\nNext: Complete API reference documentation with examples.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"18f01f650b6039ec2cc82e6b1f09190304f44299","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/trees/18f01f650b6039ec2cc82e6b1f09190304f44299"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/commits/8217fad67632b87cf6648da122c95000aed61103","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison/pan/commit/8217fad67632b87cf6648da122c95000aed61103","node_id":"C_kwDOP85_jNoAKDgyMTdmYWQ2NzYzMmI4N2NmNjY0OGRhMTIyYzk1MDAwYWVkNjExMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobiso