hrisrobison/pan/commits/eb0c2d3ddb5c5fd06d299e6a09b6656c2f695885/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-03T02:45:11Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-03T02:45:11Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"test: add critical v1.0 tests for core PAN functionality\n\nComprehensive test suite covering v1.0 release requirements:\n\n- Error handling: Invalid messages, null inputs, circular references,\n  subscription edge cases, timeout handling\n- Memory leak prevention: Subscription cleanup, request cleanup,\n  event listener accumulation, retained message bounds\n- Edge cases: Large messages (1MB), rapid publishing (1000 msgs),\n  special characters in topics, AbortSignal integration,\n  multiple clients per element\n- Concurrency: Concurrent subscriptions/publications,\n  concurrent request/reply operations with correlation\n\nTests verify core stability, memory safety, and production readiness\nfor PAN v1.0 release.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a89e7f157a96a2ce7bbc9c969ed08acd1abdaa1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/trees/a89e7f157a96a2ce7bbc9c969ed08acd1abdaa1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/commits/eb0c2d3ddb5c5fd06d299e6a09b6656c2f695885","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobiso