peScript-based test scripts with plain JavaScript:\n\nChanges:\n- npm test: Run all tests with custom test runner\n- npm run test:headed: Run tests with visible browser\n- npm run test:file: Run specific test file\n- npm run test:browser: Instructions for HTML test runner\n\nRemoved old Playwright/TypeScript test commands.\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a3d601837f16c531d0640a0bc7b07efbba11e09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/trees/2a3d601837f16c531d0640a0bc7b07efbba11e09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/commits/ed8ed524ee5f2228469caa66baef66271c699cec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison/pan/commit/ed8ed524ee5f2228469caa66baef66271c699cec","node_id":"C_kwDOP85_jNoAKGVkOGVkNTI0ZWU1ZjIyMjg0NjljYWE2NmJhZWY2NjI3MWM2OTljZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison/pan/commit/65817fdce9345057b31c174586428c749d3741e3","sha":"65817fdce9345057b31c174586428c749d3741e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/65817fdce9345057b31c174586428c749d3741e3"}],"sha":"ed8ed524ee5f2228469caa66baef66271c699cec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/ed8ed524ee5f2228469caa66baef66271c699cec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/65817fdce9345057b31c174586428c749d3741e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-30T16:13:18Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-30T16:13:18Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"feat: add zero-build test system with CLI and browser runners\n\nReplace TypeScript test system with plain JavaScript solution:\n\nCore Components:\n- test-runner.mjs: Lightweight test framework (~300 LOC)\n- cli-runner.mjs: Command-line test executor with colors\n- test-utils.mjs: Playwright integration helpers\n- index.html: Interactive browser-based test runner\n\nFeatures:\n- Zero build step - plain JavaScript modules\n- Works in both Node.js (CLI) and browser\n- API: describe, test, expect, beforeAll, afterAll, beforeEach, afterEach\n- Auto-discovers *.test.mjs files\n- Colorized CLI output\n- Visual browser UI with filter/search\n\nTest Examples:\n- simple.test.mjs: Basic unit test example\n- pan-bus.test.mjs: Playwright integration example\n- 02-todos.test.mjs: Full application test\n\nMakefile:\n- make test: Run all tests headlessly\n- make test-headed: Run with visible browser\n- make test-browser: Open HTML test runner\n\nDocumentation:\n- MIGRATION.md: Migration guide from TypeScript\n- QUICKSTART.md: Quick reference\n- README.md: Updated with new test system\n\nPhilosophy: No TypeScript transpilation, no build step.\nJust write .test.mjs files and run them immediately.\nAligns perfectly with LARC''s zero-build ethos.\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd4c620a9b83b9a5aa0e5f55e352faeb3a5ba54c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/trees/fd4c620a9b83b9a5aa0e5f55e352faeb3a5ba54c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/commits/65817fdce9345057b31c174586428c749d3741e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison/pan/commit/65817fdce9345057b31c174586428c749d3741e3","node_id":"C_kwDOP85_jNoAKDY1ODE3ZmRjZTkzNDUwNTdiMzFjMTc0NTg2NDI4Yzc0OWQzNzQxZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison/pan/commit/73cfdb12f68b583e5741c1922ecddc117031576b","sha":"73cfdb12f68b583e5741c1922ecddc117031576b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/73cfdb12f68b583e5741c1922ecddc117031576b"}],"sha":"65817fdce9345057b31c174586428c749d3741e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/65817fdce9345057b31c174586428c749d3741e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/73cfdb12f68b583e5741c1922ecddc117031576b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-30T16:12:53Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-30T16:12:53Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"feat: add complete JWT authentication system with auto-header injection\n\nAdd zero-build authentication that eliminates manual header management:\n\nCore Components:\n- pan-auth.mjs: JWT auth manager with auto-refresh, token storage\n- pan-fetch.mjs: Authenticated fetch wrapper with auto-injection\n- Enhanced pan-data-connector: Auto-inject Authorization headers\n- Enhanced pan-graphql-connector: Auto-inject Authorization headers\n\nFeatures:\n- Automatic Authorization: Bearer ${token} injection\n- Auto-refresh tokens before expiry\n- Storage options: localStorage/sessionStorage/memory\n- Topic-based API via PAN message bus\n- Complete login/logout/refresh flows\n- Zero configuration needed\n\nDemo & Testing:\n- auth-demo.html: Complete working example with beautiful UI\n- mock-auth-api.mjs: Client-side JWT simulator for testing\n- Test credentials included for immediate testing\n\nDocumentation:\n- AUTHENTICATION.md: Comprehensive 17KB guide\n- AUTH_QUICKSTART.md: Quick reference guide\n- AUTHENTICATION_SUMMARY.md: Implementation summary\n\nPhilosophy: Developers never write auth headers manually. Auth is\ninvisible infrastructure - components just request data and headers\nare automatically injected by connectors.\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fdaf48e23f653fa42f4bf1e68739c225c5d46ad7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/trees/fdaf48e23f653fa42f4bf1e68739c225c5d46ad7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/commits/73cfdb12f68b583e5741c1922ecddc117031576b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signat