ist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/e5e358883c13ec65287f9ffb56243cd5c1444870/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-27T20:43:57Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-27T20:43:57Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"refactor: clean top-level structure with pan/ component library\n\nMajor project reorganization to create a clean, approachable structure that\nreflects the simplicity and elegance of PAN.\n\n## Top-Level Changes\n\nCreated focused top-level directories:\n- pan/           - Component library (core, ui, components, data, app)\n- site/          - Website files (homepage, gallery, demos, registry)\n- apps/          - Demo applications (invoice, markdown-notes, etc.)\n- examples/      - Usage examples\n- docs/          - Documentation (including rfcs/, templates/)\n- assets/        - Shared resources (theme.css, badges/)\n- scripts/       - Build and utility scripts\n- tests/         - Test suite\n- packages/      - NPM packages\n\n## Component Library Organization (pan/)\n\nMoved all components into pan/ with clear layering:\n- pan/core/      - Infrastructure (pan-bus, pan-client, pan-autoload)\n- pan/ui/        - Simple building blocks (cards, modals, dropdowns, etc.)\n- pan/components/- Complex widgets (markdown editor, file manager, charts, etc.)\n- pan/data/      - State management (stores)\n- pan/app/       - Domain-specific (invoice/, devtools/)\n\n## Files Moved\n\nWebsite:\n- *.html (index, gallery, demos, etc.) → site/\n- conformance/ → site/conformance/\n- registry/ → site/registry/\n\nDocumentation:\n- rfcs/ → docs/rfcs/\n- templates/ → docs/templates/\n\nAssets:\n- badges/ → assets/badges/\n\n## Import Path Updates\n\nAutomatically updated 26+ files with new import paths:\n- From ./core/ → ./pan/core/\n- From ./components/ → ./pan/components/\n- From ./ui/ → ./pan/ui/\n- All apps, examples, and site files updated\n\n## Benefits\n\nFor users:\n- Immediately clear what PAN is about\n- Clean, welcoming structure\n- Easy to navigate and find components\n\nFor contributors:\n- Less clutter at top level\n- Logical grouping of related files\n- Clear separation of concerns\n\nFor the project:\n- Professional appearance\n- Scalable architecture\n- Better bundle optimization (import only what you need)\n\n## Documentation\n\n- Updated README.md with new structure\n- Created comprehensive docs/REORGANIZATION.md\n- Updated all component README files\n- All demos and examples verified working\n\nNo breaking changes - all import paths automatically updated.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e03ff476c53e89584fe8e810c95ab3af3ede83a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/trees/e03ff476c53e89584fe8e810c95ab3af3ede83a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/commits/e5e358883c13ec65287f9ffb56243cd5c1444870","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_ur