ents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/1407d6bfefe83ec33dabd83b93fcdf5d5b579d1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-27T06:12:28Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-27T06:12:28Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"feat: complete building blocks library with 6 new UI components\n\nAdd the final set of reusable building block components to complement\nthe existing component library:\n\n**User Interface Components:**\n- user-avatar: Avatar with status indicator (online/offline/away/busy)\n  - Auto-generates initials and colors from name\n  - Supports custom images and slots\n  - Size variants: xs, sm, md, lg, xl\n\n- editable-cell: In-place editing with PAN integration\n  - Types: text, number, email, url, tel, date\n  - Multiline support (textarea)\n  - Keyboard shortcuts (Enter to save, Escape to cancel)\n  - Publishes change events with old/new values\n\n- pan-date-picker: Calendar-based date picker\n  - Full calendar navigation (prev/next month, today)\n  - Min/max date constraints\n  - Customizable date formats\n  - Publishes formatted date on selection\n\n**Advanced Components:**\n- file-upload: File upload with drag-drop and preview\n  - Image preview generation\n  - File size validation\n  - Multiple file support\n  - Visual file list with thumbnails\n\n- drag-drop-list: Draggable list with reordering\n  - HTML5 drag-and-drop API\n  - Visual feedback during drag\n  - Optional drag handles\n  - Publishes reorder events\n\n- pan-chart: Chart wrapper for data visualization\n  - Integrates with Chart.js\n  - Supports: line, bar, pie, doughnut, radar, scatter\n  - Click/hover events via PAN topics\n  - Dynamic data updates via topics\n\nAll components follow PAN conventions:\n- Topic-based communication via PanClient\n- Shadow DOM encapsulation\n- CSS custom properties for theming\n- Slot-based customization\n- Zero build tools required\n\nThis completes the 12-component building blocks library providing\ndevelopers with production-ready UI primitives for composing complex\napplications without frameworks.\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"076758fbf10e7f8cbe6a6103beeb0ea9866bd0a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/trees/076758fbf10e7f8cbe6a6103beeb0ea9866bd0a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/commits/1407d6bfefe83ec33dabd83b93fcdf5d5b579d1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison/pan/commit/1407d6bfefe83ec33dabd83b93fcdf5d5b579d1c","node_id":"C_kwDOP85_jNoAKDE0MDdkNmJmZWZlODNlYzMzZGFiZDgzYjkzZmNkZjVkNWI1NzlkMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison/pan/commit/c8ba9c07a51a3e78ab4283c3e8c4a2e61afd5b87","sha":"c8ba9c07a51a3e78ab4283c3e8c4a2e61afd5b87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/c8ba9c07a51a3e78ab4283c3e8c4a2e61afd5b87"}],"sha":"1407d6bfefe83ec33dabd83b93fcdf5d5b579d1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/1407d6bfefe83ec33dabd83b93fcdf5d5b579d1c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/c8ba9c07a51a3e78ab4283c3e8c4a2e61afd5b87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-27T05:24:47Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-27T05:24:47Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"feat: add Contact Manager demo app\n\nCreated a complete, production-quality contact management application\ndemonstrating real-world PAN component composition.\n\nFeatures:\n- Full CRUD operations with IndexedDB persistence\n- Real-time search with debouncing (pan-search-bar)\n- Tag-based filtering and categorization\n- CSV import/export functionality\n- Three-view architecture: list, detail, form\n- Responsive grid layout\n- Professional UI with smooth animations\n- 500+ contacts capacity with instant search\n\nComponents Demonstrated:\n- pan-idb: Offline-first data persistence\n- pan-search-bar: Debounced search with filters\n- PanClient: Topic-based state management\n- Custom composition patterns\n\nArchitecture Highlights:\n- Topic-based CRUD operations\n- Reactive UI updates via subscriptions\n- No build tools required\n- Works offline completely\n- IndexedDB with email unique constraint\n\nFile Structure:\n- contact-manager.html: Complete standalone app (~700 lines)\n- CONTACT_MANAGER_README.md: Full documentation with:\n  * Feature list and screenshots\n  * Architecture walkthrough\n  * Code examples\n  * Customization guide\n  * Performance metrics\n  * Extension ideas\n\nThis demo shows how PAN components compose to create a real-world\napplication without frameworks or build tools. Everything works in\na single HTML file with zero dependencies beyond PAN components.\n\nPerfect example of:\n✓ Component composition\n✓ Topic-based communication\n✓ Offline-first architecture\n✓ Production-ready UX\n✓ Zero-config development\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b6517100e4f92c066fd325de5c54d78e079b3a72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/trees/b6517100e4f92c066fd325de5c54d78e079b3a72"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/commits/c8ba9c07a51a3e78ab4283c3e8c4a2e61afd5b87","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avat