in":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/028d3be462e0bca656281770fa31bc967afc4cdc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-27T05:20:55Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-27T05:20:55Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"docs: add comprehensive demo app ideas document\n\nCreated DEMO_IDEAS.md with 12 detailed demo app concepts organized\nby complexity tier:\n\nTier 1 - Quick Wins (2-4 days each):\n- Task Manager with real-time sync\n- Contact/CRM Manager\n- Expense Tracker Dashboard\n\nTier 2 - Impressive Demos (5-7 days each):\n- Kanban/Project Board\n- Live Spreadsheet Application\n- Chat/Messaging App\n- E-commerce Product Admin\n\nTier 3 - Enterprise Showcases (7-10 days each):\n- Analytics Dashboard\n- Calendar/Scheduling App\n- CMS/Blog Editor\n- Restaurant Order System\n- Code Playground/REPL\n\nEach demo includes:\n- Required components\n- Feature list\n- What it demonstrates\n- Real-world value\n- Estimated complexity\n\nAlso includes:\n- Top 5 recommended starting demos\n- Component composition patterns\n- Building blocks checklist\n- Demo organization structure\n- Success metrics\n\nThis document serves as the roadmap for creating production-quality\ndemo applications that showcase PAN''s composability and real-world\nutility.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-