cdc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/a8ec8b4be6910b38e148d0b832e197c09679d5e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-27T05:16:21Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-27T05:16:21Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"feat: add reusable UI building block components (part 1)\n\nCreated 6 essential reusable components for composing demo apps:\n\n1. pan-card: Generic card container with variants, elevation, slots\n   - Supports header, footer, actions slots\n   - Visual variants: default, primary, secondary, danger, success\n   - Hoverable option with smooth animations\n\n2. pan-modal: Modal dialog with PAN topic control\n   - Show/hide via topics: {topic}.show, {topic}.hide, {topic}.toggle\n   - Publishes opened/closed events\n   - Configurable sizes: sm, md, lg, xl, full\n   - Keyboard and backdrop close support\n\n3. pan-dropdown: Dropdown menu with topic integration\n   - Publishes select events with value/label\n   - Configurable positioning (4 positions)\n   - JSON-based items or slot-based custom content\n   - Keyboard navigation ready\n\n4. pan-tabs: Tabbed interface with PAN integration\n   - Topic-based tab switching\n   - Publishes tab change events\n   - JSON config or auto-discover from slots\n   - Accessible with ARIA attributes\n\n5. pan-pagination: Full-featured pagination control\n   - Supports total-items and page-size calculations\n   - First/last/prev/next buttons\n   - Smart ellipsis for many pages\n   - Optional jump-to-page input\n   - Publishes page change events\n\n6. pan-search-bar: Search input with filters and debounce\n   - Configurable debounce delay\n   - Optional filter dropdown\n   - Clear button\n   - Real-time search events\n\nAll components follow PAN patterns:\n- Topic-based communication\n- Shadow DOM encapsulation\n- CSS custom properties for theming\n- Accessible markup\n- Clean slot-based composition\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6935e2bbe784fe9555140b9c109f5bd6e31f3bd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/trees/6935e2bbe784fe9555140b9c109f5bd6e31f3bd6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/commits/a8ec8b4be6910b38e148d0b832e197c09679d5e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison/pan/commit/a8ec8b4be6910b38e148d0b832e197c09679d5e9","node_id":"C_kwDOP85_jNoAKGE4ZWM4YjRiZTY5MTBiMzhlMTQ4ZDBiODMyZTE5N2MwOTY3OWQ1ZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison/pan/commit/d80439ff3fcc4e30323deb7710235e4f5f2ccfd6","sha":"d80439ff3fcc4e30323deb7710235e4f5f2ccfd6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/d80439ff3fcc4e30323deb7710235e4f5f2ccfd6"}],"sha":"a8ec8b4be6910b38e148d0b832e197c09679d5e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/a8ec8b4be6910b38e148d0b832e197c09679d5e9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/d80439ff3fcc4e30323deb7710235e4f5f2ccfd6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-27T03:35:56Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-27T03:35:56Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"feat: automatically create pan-bus in autoload\n\nThe pan-autoload script now automatically creates and initializes a\n<pan-bus> element if one doesn''t already exist. This eliminates\nboilerplate and prevents the common error of forgetting to include\nthe bus.\n\nChanges:\n- Added ensurePanBus() function to autoload\n- Automatically creates <pan-bus> as first child of body/documentElement\n- Loads pan-bus module before other components\n- Updated homepage example to remove explicit <pan-bus> tag\n- Updated README quickstart and autoload docs\n\nBenefits:\n- One less thing for users to remember\n- Impossible to forget the bus component\n- Even simpler \"10 second\" quickstart (now just 3 lines!)\n- More \"batteries included\" philosophy\n\nExample now looks like:\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<script type=\"module\" src=\"...pan-autoload.mjs\"></script>\n<x-counter></x-counter>\n<pan-inspector></pan-inspector>\n```\n\nThe <pan-bus> is created automatically and available immediately.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f00404bd63cfb423809040e52dbd65c45ede7256","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/trees/f00404bd63cfb423809040e52dbd65c45ede7256"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/commits/d80439ff3fcc4e30323deb7710235e4f5f2ccfd6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events