w==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/66502a1807786a74f893867267226cf01bc4bdbf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-27T03:29:58Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-27T03:29:58Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"feat: use GitHub Pages CDN URL in 10-second example\n\nUpdated the homepage example to use the GitHub Pages URL instead of\na relative path. This makes the example actually work when users\ncopy and paste it into a new HTML file.\n\nBefore: ./components/pan-autoload.mjs (requires local files)\nAfter: https://chrisrobison.github.io/pan/components/pan-autoload.mjs\n\nNow the 10-second example is truly copy-paste-and-run, requiring zero\nsetup or file downloads. Users can immediately test LARC PAN without\ncloning the repo or setting up a local server.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c14eee8b5ca8d8e3dde8950116ff9100fc70c819","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/trees/c14eee8b5ca8d8e3dde8950116ff9100fc70c819"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/commits/66502a1807786a74f893867267226cf01bc4bdbf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.gi