rl":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/4fe92cb8434d11e04d9aed175fe8e70a37e0a97a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-27T03:26:34Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-27T03:26:34Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"feat: simplify 10-second example to showcase autoload\n\nUpdated the homepage \"Get Started in 10 Seconds\" example to use the\nnew pan-autoload system instead of manual imports and component\ndefinition. This dramatically simplifies the example:\n\nBefore: 30+ lines with imports and component class definition\nAfter: 4 lines of HTML with autoload script tag\n\nThe new example demonstrates:\n- Single script tag autoload setup\n- Automatic component loading on demand\n- Zero manual imports or registration\n- Added pan-inspector to show real-time messaging\n\nAlso added styled .code-section-note for highlighting key benefits.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb249b33d5e5c4fb6c8d9be39c80d1119b25400f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/trees/bb249b33d5e5c4fb6c8d9be39c80d1119b25400f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/commits/4fe92cb8434d11e04d9aed175fe8e70a37e0a97a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison/pan/commit/4fe92cb8434d11e04d9aed175fe8e70a37e0a97a","node_id":"C_kwDOP85_jNoAKDRmZTkyY2I4NDM0ZDExZTA0ZDlhZWQxNzVmZThlNzBhMzdlMGE5N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison/pan/commit/f70e97f948ea21ad2f38c8608ed9da80409fd199","sha":"f70e97f948ea21ad2f38c8608ed9da80409fd199","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/f70e97f948ea21ad2f38c8608ed9da80409fd199"}],"sha":"4fe92cb8434d11e04d9aed175fe8e70a37e0a97a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/4fe92cb8434d11e04d9aed175fe8e70a37e0a97a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/f70e97f948ea21ad2f38c8608ed9da80409fd199/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-27T02:12:15Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-27T02:12:15Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"feat: add router, websocket, indexeddb components and gallery\n\nThis major update adds three critical new components and a comprehensive\ncomponent gallery for exploring the LARC PAN ecosystem:\n\nNew Components:\n- pan-router: SPA routing with nav.state synchronization\n  * History and hash mode support\n  * Route guards with auth integration\n  * Path parameters and query string parsing\n  * Programmatic navigation via topics\n\n- pan-link: Declarative navigation with active state\n  * Automatic active class management\n  * Exact and prefix matching modes\n  * SPA link interception\n\n- pan-websocket: Bidirectional WebSocket bridge\n  * Auto-reconnection with exponential backoff\n  * Heartbeat/ping support\n  * Topic filtering for inbound/outbound messages\n  * Connection status events\n\n- pan-idb: IndexedDB operations via PAN topics\n  * Full CRUD through topic-based API\n  * Index support with queries\n  * Multiple stores and databases\n  * Schema migration on version changes\n\nComponent Gallery:\n- Interactive component showcase at gallery.html\n- Live playground with code editor and preview\n- Search and category filtering\n- Direct links to source code\n\nNew Examples:\n- examples/15-router.html: SPA routing demo\n- examples/16-websocket.html: Real-time chat\n- examples/17-indexeddb.html: Contact manager with persistence\n\nUpdated CHANGELOG.md with comprehensive feature documentation.\n\nThese additions complete Milestone 2 from the roadmap (router + schema form)\nand add foundational pieces for M3 (WebSocket bridge, IDB access).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a13c9effeedccb876956822b740c2babc1d091a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/trees/8a13c9effeedccb876956822b740c2babc1d091a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/commits/f70e97f948ea21ad2f38c8608ed9da80409fd199","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison/pan/commit/f70e97f948ea21ad2f38c8608ed9da80409fd199","node_id":"C_kwDOP85_jNoAKGY3MGU5N2Y5NDhlYTIxYWQyZjM4Yzg2MDhlZDlkYTgwNDA5ZmQxOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison/pan/commit/48214712c4e78e6894a61fa1346664bf7afccbb6","sha":"48214712c4e78e6894a61fa1346664bf7afccbb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/48214712c4e78e6894a61fa1346664bf7afccbb6"}],"sha":"f70e97f948ea21ad2f38c8608ed9da80409fd199","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/f70e97f948ea21ad2f38c8608ed9da80409fd199"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/commits/48214712c4e78e6894a61fa1346664bf7afccbb6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-27T01:56:02Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-27T01:56:02Z","email":"cdr@netoasis.net","name":"Christopher Robison"},"message":"feat: implement component autoload system and modernize documentation\n\nThis commit introduces a major architectural improvement to LARC PAN:\n\n- Add pan-autoload.mjs for automatic component loading on demand\n- Migrate all components from dist/ to components/ directory\n- Update all examples and demos to use new autoload system\n- Completely redesign index.html with modern landing page\n- Add comprehensive demos.html showcase page\n- Update README.md with detailed autoload documentation\n- Improve .gitignore to exclude package-lock.json\n\nThe autoload system eliminates the need for manual imports - components\nload automatically when their custom elements are detected in the DOM,\nmaking LARC PAN even more lightweight and developer-friendly.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb8f21540aa0e87c50604fb998d94b1d698c1bef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/trees/bb8f21540aa0e87c50604fb998d94b1d698c1bef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chrisrobison/pan/git/commits/48214712c4e78e6894a61fa1346664bf7afccbb6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/877847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisrobison","id":877847,"login":"chrisrobison","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Nzg0Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisrobison