},"message":"🎉 Project Drishti v1.0 - Complete AI-Powered UFDR Analysis System\n\n✨ Features Implemented:\n- 🧠 Hybrid Intelligence Architecture (SQL + Vector DB)\n- 🕵️ Detective Tool: Text-to-SQL with Gemini 2.5 Pro\n- 💬 Interrogator Tool: RAG for unstructured data analysis\n- 🔗 Link Analyzer: Cross-reference correlations\n- 📊 Forensic-friendly visualizations and dashboards\n- 📤 Court-ready CSV export functionality\n- 🎯 Streamlit UI with investigation-focused interface\n\n📂 Complete Project Structure:\n- Core agents: ingest_data.py, agent_core.py, app.py\n- Sample data: 4 UFDR cases with 35+ realistic files\n- Documentation: 2,500+ lines across 6 files\n- Setup automation: Linux/Mac and Windows scripts\n- 300 forensic query examples in QUESTIONS.md\n\n🔧 Technical Stack:\n- Python 3.13 with Gemini 2.5 Pro (thinking mode enabled)\n- SQLite (prototype) → PostgreSQL (production ready)\n- ChromaDB for semantic search\n- Streamlit for interactive UI\n- SQLAlchemy for seamless database migration\n\n🎯 Ready for forensic investigators to analyze:\n- Call patterns, SMS analysis, financial transactions\n- WhatsApp chats, device info, location data\n- Timeline reconstruction, anomaly detection\n- Cross-case analysis and pattern recognition\n\n📈 Production Features:\n- Pydantic v2 compatibility fixed\n- Duplicate element ID issues resolved\n- Rate limiting handled for API quotas\n- Comprehensive error handling and logging\n- Export-ready visualizations for court use","tree":{"sha":"03c226a006513f357978a36aedd50a86417c7054","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pswaikar1742/Drishti/git/trees/03c226a006513f357978a36aedd50a86417c7054"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pswaikar1742/Drishti/git/commits/0b0d12ca9af5c41854f8fc417821b25883b1b64c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120075756?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pswaikar1742/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pswaikar1742/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pswaikar1742/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pswaikar1742/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Pswaikar1742","id":120075756,"login":"Pswaikar1742","node_id":"U_kgDOByg17A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pswaikar1742/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pswaikar1742/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pswaikar1742/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pswaikar1742/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pswaikar1742/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pswaikar1742","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Pswaikar1742/Drishti/commit/0b0d12ca9af5c41854f8fc417821b25883b1b64c","node_id":"C_kwDOP9BgmdoAKDBiMGQxMmNhOWFmNWM0MTg1NGY4ZmM0MTc4MjFiMjU4ODNiMWI2NGM","parents":[],"sha":"0b0d12ca9af5c41854f8fc417821b25883b1b64c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pswaikar1742/Drishti/commits/0b0d12ca9af5c41854f8fc417821b25883b1b64c"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pswaikar1742/Drishti/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=0b0d12ca9af5c41854f8fc417821b25883b1b64c&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A24%3A17.850Z"}');
