"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/perses/shared/commit/587fc1bf75338833cd6f3b6294c3fc0b8ee0af0c","node_id":"C_kwDOP9R3AdoAKDU4N2ZjMWJmNzUzMzg4MzNjZDZmM2I2Mjk0YzNmYzBiOGVlMGFmMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perses/shared/commit/e4a8af457701c55d9a7544557b1e672f153b2691","sha":"e4a8af457701c55d9a7544557b1e672f153b2691","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/commits/e4a8af457701c55d9a7544557b1e672f153b2691"}],"sha":"587fc1bf75338833cd6f3b6294c3fc0b8ee0af0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/commits/587fc1bf75338833cd6f3b6294c3fc0b8ee0af0c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5657041?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gladorme/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gladorme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gladorme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gladorme/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Gladorme","id":5657041,"login":"Gladorme","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NTcwNDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gladorme/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gladorme/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gladorme/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gladorme/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gladorme/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gladorme","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/commits/e4a8af457701c55d9a7544557b1e672f153b2691/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:17:41Z","email":"Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume LADORME"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:17:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[BREAKINGCHANGE] Refactor Annotation store (#330)\n\n* [ENHANCEMENT] Annotation: remove hydration wrapper\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* [ENHANCEMENT] Annotations: keep panel annotations stable across renders\n\nFollow-up of the hydration wrapper removal. useAnnotationsWithData and\nusePanelAnnotationsWithData still returned a new array on every render: useQueries returns\na new results array each time, and the pairs were rebuilt with flatMap. Time series panels\nuse this array as a dependency, so every panel render rebuilt the annotation series,\nre-bound every ECharts event handler and rebuilt the chart option.\n\n- Pair specs with their data through useAnnotationSpecsWithData, memoized on the specs and\n  the data references, so the arrays keep their identity until the data actually changes.\n- Annotation queries use the [''annotation'', spec, timeRange, variables] key again. The\n  [''query'', ''Annotation'', ...] key no longer matched the [''annotation'', spec] invalidation\n  of the annotation editor preview, so re-running an unchanged preview did nothing.\n- TimeRangeProvider refresh and auto refresh invalidate [''annotation''] and remove inactive\n  annotation queries, so annotations keep following dashboard refreshes and old time range\n  entries do not accumulate in the cache.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <gladorme@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Ignore annotation hidden + identity stable\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix remarks\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Review\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Simpler, less opti\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Apply Antoine feedbacks\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Apply Nexucis feedbacks\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <gladorme@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"449d0ff8b8bcdbe10e744178d66a96cabc2eb7db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/git/trees/449d0ff8b8bcdbe10e744178d66a96cabc2eb7db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/git/commits/e4a8af457701c55d9a7544557b1e672f153b2691","verification":{"payload":"tree 449d0ff8b8bcdbe10e744178d66a96cabc2eb7db\nparent b8741ffa0a53ab9214114b5c779cd16f576e0144\nauthor Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com> 1791379061 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791379061 +0200\n\n[BREAKINGCHANGE] Refactor Annotation store (#330)\n\n* [ENHANCEMENT] Annotation: remove hydration wrapper\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* [ENHANCEMENT] Annotations: keep panel annotations stable across renders\n\nFollow-up of the hydration wrapper removal. useAnnotationsWithData and\nusePanelAnnotationsWithData still returned a new array on every render: useQueries returns\na new results array each time, and the pairs were rebuilt with flatMap. Time series panels\nuse this array as a dependency, so every panel render rebuilt the annotation series,\nre-bound every ECharts event handler and rebuilt the chart option.\n\n- Pair specs with their data through useAnnotationSpecsWithData, memoized on the specs and\n  the data references, so the arrays keep their identity until the data actually changes.\n- Annotation queries use the [''annotation'', spec, timeRange, variables] key again. The\n  [''query'', ''Annotation'', ...] key no longer matched the [''annotation'', spec] invalidation\n  of the annotation editor preview, so re-running an unchanged preview did nothing.\n- TimeRangeProvider refresh and auto refresh invalidate [''annotation''] and remove inactive\n  annotation queries, so annotations keep following dashboard refreshes and old time range\n  entries do not accumulate in the cache.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <gladorme@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Ignore annotation hidden + identity stable\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix remarks\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Review\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Simpler, less opti\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Apply Antoine feedbacks\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Apply Nexucis feedbacks\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <gladorme@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxkZ1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIW0QADBPe4HzvpOYuvmnSWEiPbHq\nbG5Ch4t1wptIyK/VloKkS1tcjPAOefN9r1Daxw7nWvqFUsfZ5IFYrDDiCOw1Wij7\nZSSDyfsNtYjlq4N3wYG8v6W3+ZqCtAn49xnbtMY1tz4U4fyLrODoya1wHlklELhQ\ndcv+jmtNu7bW2z7Ao5AhxXv9RIECAdXf4odt7Zu8wg+yzo2c/+txJy24p043i9OY\nQLi175h66kqP7+kl1IcVKzxuYGr