ithub.com/users/melihgurlek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melihgurlek/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/melihgurlek","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/commits/c7d6a66a2e15a0b8ad4a4e1b974e7a184b44c33d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T11:41:38Z","email":"96010213+melihgurlek@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Melih Gürlek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T11:41:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[BUGFIX] Fix panel links menu not opening inside the overflow menu (#255)\n\nLinksDisplay''s icon button opens its own MUI Menu on click, but the\nclick event bubbles up to the ancestor OverflowMenu''s wrapping\n<Stack onClick={handleClose}>. On narrow panels, where the links\nbutton collapses into that overflow menu, this closes (and unmounts)\nthe overflow before the links menu can render, so it never opens.\n\nFixes #3654\n\nSigned-off-by: Melih Gürlek <melihgurlek@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ba4d0a87a5361513b9b55b15e60f0c2677c4b48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/git/trees/4ba4d0a87a5361513b9b55b15e60f0c2677c4b48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/git/commits/c7d6a66a2e15a0b8ad4a4e1b974e7a184b44c33d","verification":{"payload":"tree 4ba4d0a87a5361513b9b55b15e60f0c2677c4b48\nparent 6e476ada622e19d5a1309d52f2e566caabbfbcca\nauthor Melih Gürlek <96010213+melihgurlek@users.noreply.github.com> 1788435698 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788435698 +0200\n\n[BUGFIX] Fix panel links menu not opening inside the overflow menu (#255)\n\nLinksDisplay''s icon button opens its own MUI Menu on click, but the\nclick event bubbles up to the ancestor OverflowMenu''s wrapping\n<Stack onClick={handleClose}>. On narrow panels, where the links\nbutton collapses into that overflow menu, this closes (and unmounts)\nthe overflow before the links menu can render, so it never opens.\n\nFixes #3654\n\nSigned-off-by: Melih Gürlek <melihgurlek@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmVzyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABD4QADSuB+p8uSsoCy5XGTDcYIKu\nhCvujrfWDRc56IfhmWI4+pbBRRKeer5qckF6v+vCFNIoFRSnVPNKo2m5Q0Rvckqe\nw2kI6Y0iZQSI/sWTngQX4xMHnhHxLun9L24JARwBRSeKXy5NjEh0+WP3H0iuaVB6\ne3Pm8Gf4HF/49LcbcXeSw0NSehOkdIbndpcFdN4NG40mVlz4vGATHEKzJEv9S1fU\nHnMevyZUj3T3kpTjoGoC5pZKlKJsJBnkQNGXDdhktoXS12Y/NmKmRRGcx5z8tkO3\nzzDqM2/93v9y9zfB6h8IzaK/ImWrbY7lZEy7sVXILVnTtWo9MzWSVIplYmWX45bC\na8k4itUoLzQDniPfNNaNTErIB6xKQLeKKNs+21BBUxZLPOx8w1aaJV75Avr8HT4n\nPMVzj8AurKGIarmN4vPNu7CI0l9ZPSeBgoQeKJWVOi5cz45x+PI/9tFUWfjeIN/2\nJ/Jd05RmgVkIV3v4p+Fy+BJvekL/I01XT6WT0/Q8r1+XwbI2bJlegsdu4dvklzMl\nioy/K32AXrCozizWfupMg95YwY0e7/AFR4go3w/r78LSfywMVNGzkfw6Gxhx5EEB\neXah4IMzizWYZO1LElFY8qRxgxNxEKel/pvYpH/a0iCcCqVS7qR8TU1k2pLULagP\nlDeHOVAyZBsMIXhhSbWC\n=yJjB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-03T11:41:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/perses/shared/commit/c7d6a66a2e15a