.github.com/users/niharikag09/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niharikag09/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niharikag09/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niharikag09/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niharikag09","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/commits/b8c9d4cfed26e7e8bdd4b41c9c83579bcaef060f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T09:28:42Z","email":"niharikag09@gmail.com","name":"Niharika Jha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T09:28:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[BUGFIX] Sync dashboard state with query parameters (#218)\n\n* [BUGFIX] Sync dashboard state with query parameters\n\nUpdate variable and viewed-panel state when client-side navigation changes URL query parameters without remounting providers.\n\nPreserve runtime variable metadata and avoid URL feedback loops while restoring defaults when parameters are removed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCopilot-Session: c4cf3b16-36e7-4e36-b731-560fe823d1f8\nSigned-off-by: Niharika Jha <niharikajha@microsoft.com>\n\n* [BUGFIX] Preserve variable values during query sync\n\nNormalize single-value multi-select parameters without rebuilding variable state, and cover URL round trips, defaults, and the all-value sentinel.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\nCopilot-Session: de3410ea-8dea-4801-bf44-d2347b082b07\nSigned-off-by: Niharika Jha <niharikajha@microsoft.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Niharika Jha <niharikajha@microsoft.com>\nCo-authored-by: Niharika Jha <niharikajha@microsoft.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCopilot-Session: c4cf3b16-36e7-4e36-b731-560fe823d1f8\nCopilot-Session: de3410ea-8dea-4801-bf44-d2347b082b07","tree":{"sha":"9e81acb1ab220e91