hub.com/users/nicolastakashi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/commits/2bd7af18b3cbf06fa6b5305054d65c88b46d595c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T14:09:05Z","email":"nicolas.takashi@dash0.com","name":"Nicolas Takashi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T14:09:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[BUGFIX] Load and edit panel-level annotations in the panel editor (#225)\n\nusePanelEditor rebuilt the panel spec from only {display, plugin, queries, links},\ndropping spec.annotations. So the Annotations tab never showed a panel''s existing\nannotations (and the preview could not render them). Thread annotations through\nusePanelEditor and wire an onAnnotationsChange callback from PanelSpecEditor so the\neditor state and react-hook-form stay in sync.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>","tree":{"sha":"3cc3e2166b0111bfae5398347916439b97ed0e3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/git/trees/3cc3e2166b0111bfae5398347916439b97ed0e3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/git/commits/2bd7af18b3cbf06fa6b5305054d65c88b46d595c","verification":{"payload":"tree 3cc3e2166b0111bfae5398347916439b97ed0e3f\nparent 9d6678198f601d2f97fe53452c04a4d65c47d034\nauthor Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com> 1786716545 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786716545 +0100\n\n[BUGFIX] Load and edit panel-level annotations in the panel editor (#225)\n\nusePanelEditor rebuilt the panel spec from only {display, plugin, queries, links},\ndropping spec.annotations. So the Annotations tab never showed a panel''s existing\nannotations (and the preview could not render them). Thread annotations through\nusePanelEditor and wire an onAnnotationsChange callback from PanelSpecEditor so the\neditor state and react-hook-form stay in sync.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGI