ss-deps, per the release doc. Carries the panel-level annotations work (#206). External @perses-dev/spec stays at 0.3.0-beta.0.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>","tree":{"sha":"d4a30e43230b36759c1fda10cbb7f2ba95ed7204","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/git/trees/d4a30e43230b36759c1fda10cbb7f2ba95ed7204"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/git/commits/8810be6c8e259751bed99e8bc83996c826f3a0eb","verification":{"payload":"tree d4a30e43230b36759c1fda10cbb7f2ba95ed7204\nparent f7fb4cc726b6ecafc589fa984fc99d6e9dd1e16e\nauthor Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com> 1786440262 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786440262 +0100\n\nPrepare release v0.55.0-beta.0 (#220)\n\nFirst beta of the 0.55 line. Bumps all workspace packages to 0.55.0-beta.0 (root, client, components, dashboards, explore, plugin-system) and their @perses-dev/* cross-deps, per the release doc. Carries the panel-level annotations work (#206). External @perses-dev/spec stays at 0.3.0-beta.0.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqeupGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9fkQAHzVwj9SMZ8bM6TP9LnHB94L\nRMeRk5Xep6TAqSHUT268+f5ja2rasF4BEuyK/YHG6qxfYieEByzgbmtfv/pRj+BS\nWRYCLqfVVZgVRegMS5MwD1obwfTNB0GlpAmk3+Q+O0X1JNZ0xWmcNXLyjkRPjeI0\nXojd7SyLjSpZ24h+uxRXoR3Wq7+qv+vFyO4ifnOlKyS1yVstCXdlg6kwz7ENqqCG\nH500oMSJr+3SyEENHMp75drv5UbFK0GTuGnJFh/1t8NRP2OsnSyVSGHoMPEhJmqq\n0qhR6JmZFpFXX4/rQQ0/kjglD1T+6x9xKjsc7aYsPmR8IKlcCLHJxkx9yZlzv8Hs\n3oM6/TeEqdmtt6kzrUX/dVfrFSUagh6fpB3P0IAeO+9ZWbM2RS28FahQj89ar8f5\nwrAEGqzWxJjlN+R/UDX/qHgieP5b5JZr5XwGw/xMPKhXJ3+Tj/7Lvq9MMuqKKi6j\nh4NiLNuosxB/QJbFp13ihTA+/nzkUN4upncpfCYF/KBTmxqQ1A++XaFdH2kLbWdw\nB4iEmUuIeBIgxrr6F/7+VwRSaQmX89K13ZFUyeUK3LqRWIBuf9Iic8okFz1PqyfB\nHonb8YoAGhOlxeiPQw6yD4AFtIzJfyF0vUWwIbkK4GkmlQ3EaKqIlwNaG96Laouc\nJ+B1ARFTnakuhrSf7Bps\n=mYjS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-11T09:27:0