gin":"nicolastakashi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDU1NDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolastakashi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolastakashi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolastakashi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolastakashi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolastakashi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nicolastakashi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/commits/f7fb4cc726b6ecafc589fa984fc99d6e9dd1e16e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T16:01:09Z","email":"nicolas.takashi@dash0.com","name":"Nicolas Takashi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T16:01:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[FEATURE] Add panel-level annotations: consumer hook + editor tab (#206)\n\n* [FEATURE] Add usePanelAnnotationsWithData hook for panel-level annotations\n\nAdd a panel-scoped consumer hook in @perses-dev/dashboards. It returns the\ndashboard-level annotations from the store unless the panel toggle disables them\n(annotations.enabled === false; a nil or true value keeps them on), and merges in\nthe panel-local definitions resolved through the existing useAnnotations runtime\nhook. The merge is a plain concatenation of both sets.\n\nReuses AnnotationSpecWithData and the AnnotationProvider store; no fetching logic\nis duplicated. Includes unit tests for the toggle and merge behavior.\n\nDepends on the panel-level annotations data model in perses/spec#61.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>\n\n* [FEATURE] Add panel-level annotations editor tab\n\nExpose per-panel annotations in the panel editor as a common tab, shown only for panel\nplugins that declare the new PanelPlugin.supportsAnnotations capability (matching the\nexisting hideQueryEditor gate). The tab reuses AnnotationEditorForm for the per-annotation\nform and edits spec.panels[].spec.annotations directly, so no new rendering is introduced.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>","tree":{"sha":"54af92e39de9338d4dc95ae8c7cf9130ac92fed2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/git/trees/54af92e39de9338d4dc95ae8c7cf9130ac92fed2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/git/commits/f7fb4cc726b6ecafc589fa984fc99d6e9dd1e16e","verification":{"payload":"tree 54af92e39de9338d4dc95ae8c7cf9130ac92fed2\nparent efbd4a6a2f8dd81f6bb155caaebcdb454c54ffe0\nauthor Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com> 1786377669 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786377669 +0100\n\n[FEATURE] Add panel-level annotations: consumer hook + editor tab (#206)\n\n* [FEATURE] Add usePanelAnnotationsWithData hook for panel-level annotations\n\nAdd a panel-scoped consumer hook in @perses-dev/dashboards. It returns the\ndashboard-level annotations from the store unless the panel toggle disables them\n(annotations.enabled === false; a nil or true value keeps them on), and merges in\nthe panel-local definitions resolved through the existing useAnnotations runtime\nhook. The merge is a plain concatenation of both sets.\n\nReuses AnnotationSpecWithData and the AnnotationProvider store; no fetching logic\nis duplicated. Includes unit tests for the toggle and merge behavior.\n\nDepends on the panel-level annotations data model in perses/spec#61.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>\n\n* [FEATURE] Add panel-level annotations editor tab\n\nExpose per-panel annotations in the panel editor as a common tab, shown only for panel\nplugins that declare the new PanelPlugin.supportsAnnotations capability (matching the\nexisting hideQueryEditor gate). The tab reuses AnnotationEditorForm for the per-annotation\nform and edits spec.panels[].spec.annotations directly, so no new rendering is introduced.\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Nicolas Takashi <nicolas.takashi@dash0.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqefXFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAm4EQAGoBq/PeIdXz4obF6arRiELW\nIMGGdKxeOekwZQ1BSPp8cSfnOKMGooZCiV2GgPhuvXmrME8Y7d7db4vuKzAovOYa\nfcNc/689+Wy1An0IX5oW8F8X3ym7Q9/YhJVfL/TJBG5C/U5S4/TENhfn3mtQfNTi\n5NRQY4jx7E1UlwKZDBIbeyAFJhX1ub+jThyN54CK0CZ1JSU28AMgc1p5S2rzc4PG\nCofx7e1N9+KgkGb+spiDEz8VSXdgG1gKKKTIuLoz834DLH/ESplrSQDlExvUeGJq\n3/u7SKAIg0JuQ0R8KAo9/8TaoREkpUsuXPWP4sRnTv7LgM3FCesQGTf0TsOYqx6c\n6CACz/JXtKSnz7FvXNak8bMdYgpqRFvkkI2U/vWZFsL+rWq+k2CSO2i0kHn0r2pM\n8J17QaJI8ucLdDECMebPI7i9chrKIAzxGovyY8fF2N1DOE7nujcqOMOoDSJSOZoi\nAoe9GtNTNCtA58qUdqUm88GBbx03H9YxK1kLAvBKUmaDd5M9E+96Hb5PVSeCMh07\nB1WLUyJfbD5k0Rj/5aArz6sclJiYqCf1x5Z5fC8J3rXwdnUBd4iMhwLmxKpPLCpS\n6scGVXhMZjsYrJtJRLobNOfbFVQ/Qv65W3FbFfdr14MtHmvJJhjVD5N/4EPLL94i\ndtezMZWi33kRAfeoSYTC\n=scll\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-10T16:01:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_t