url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/commits/a12a5db467d9c1c8350f33ff391940e1854b0ef2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538011?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreasgerstmayr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreasgerstmayr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreasgerstmayr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreasgerstmayr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andreasgerstmayr","id":538011,"login":"andreasgerstmayr","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODAxMQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreasgerstmayr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreasgerstmayr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreasgerstmayr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreasgerstmayr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreasgerstmayr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andreasgerstmayr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/commits/5e546bac5e8b79060f731ec017a0af58db4a9e73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T08:26:01Z","email":"agerstmayr@redhat.com","name":"Andreas Gerstmayr"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T08:26:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[BUGFIX] fix race condition with initial query plugin spec (#199)\n\nuseDefaultQueryDefinition() returned isLoading: false while the plugin\nwas still loading (only the metadata loading state was checked). This\ncaused the initial plugin spec to be set to {} because\ndefaultQueryPlugin was undefined.\n\nFix by combining both the metadata and plugin loading states into a\nsingle composite isLoading flag.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Gerstmayr <agerstmayr@redhat.com>","tree":{"sha":"b829be4670802ce6e6654a6b34957d9bd4a3cb07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/git/trees/b829be4670802ce6e6654a6b34957d9bd4a3cb07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/shared/git/commits/5e546bac5e8b79060f731ec017a0af58db4a9e73","verification":{"payload":"tree b829be4670802ce6e6654a6b34957d9bd4a3cb07\nparent 180780ed009ee7442f85af44e9916243d124d975\nauthor Andreas Gerstmayr <agerstmayr@redhat.com> 1784190361 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784190361 +0200\n\n[BUGFIX] fix race condition with initial query plugin spec (#199)\n\nuseDefaultQueryDefinition() returned isLoading: false while the plugin\nwas still loading (only the metadata loading state was checked). This\ncaused the initial plugin spec to be set to {} because\ndefaultQueryPlugin was undefined.\n\nFix by combining both the metadata and plugin loading states into a\nsingle composite isLoading flag.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Gerstmayr <agerstmayr@redhat.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqWJWZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvTUQADFwmBtDvgApnPoCo/KW2/A9\nrxdqMvT/flaA5qXrNY7a76TajytA3+mqCFfsN2csXANGl0vPeq52pFoFnR2sdOtC\ndy0fVGZwdza7XPHx7IRpTidLYzKfIDKxV/yxYWGuygzYZqR3CxHmd8qWbRgnvy8P\nsvJfQ3ogU0TYodMIbxllzpttt5DiFsyPFHMIULq+NyDCKj8eOuvNjmrTXSSS6Rm3\nK7ckZuVRxuaIWwKJoU8rwgeinFltr5+aYZ6q7msDje7nf9l7ojTsNgzwX/ijuroT\nEpLAjajAMI2KRiCtaxoNRLUM5FpkvQs6kBL1R3mYN/qwNaNGeZ6Qc0zCL9xUrB0s\nrX4CLyn2fVwysRPhHGAYhqnH2b1BnDbG3SsQlFWWgqbcgnRIhR9tCxE9Mycz9Qnb\nJTOCnl6BdWl1WwD3Jfm/Gz4tnY+R55/3BLuzB120PvXFEcCFJ+3MXY/ZdwDaEGTe\nR1PB6EY/wd4bEjNOqs1X3P5GZEMhIPFsJMz2ZcguYb9lTGwovOvKI7lF78ORf3NX\nm7gtBJrFTQh/vI8WqJJtq5mI880TA/4pFdSAz/R6qoamtUcTY7vMgKnATqUPKisW\n3iTV9PUw3EdGgqecFcSrYFDxVcroJoaEQlEJH0a2jrOmCJUMcIBBQjiIuTB38iGN\nrHNBTr8dEk8apRCh2g63\n=7mFy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T08:26:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url"